<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Kuloonaay</book>
  <para style="h">Saŋ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyya Saŋ naakiice ya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Saŋ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyya Saŋ naakiice ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Saŋ</para>
  <para style="imt">Waah wa weeyem wa ti púkoo eyye</para>
  <para style="ip">Eehe hiyem ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti Yéesu Krista, eeha <char style="w">Saŋ</char> naakiice ha. Akina Saŋ, neetaat Saŋ-Patis pale akee ti <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka pakati Yéesu. Naakiic pikee púkuu empa Mark, Máciya niŋ Luk nkakiicut.</para>
  <para style="ip">Púkoo eyye esoke nii, Yéesu ayem <char style="w">Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>; apan Hilim ha niŋ Pútuun pa, poko kayem nantoonool kápiliŋ. Hilim eehuu híkeyii pikin niŋ pakan paka, níhihin kéeyinane ka teeho kápiyini éyenoonii epuuk Pútuun.</para>
  <para style="ip">Saŋ naakaman weecukantee wa uti Yéesu wéeyisane wa nii, akina ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char>, Añii ya ati Pútuun pa (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:30-31">20:30-31</ref></char>); naakaman lompo pucukool pa piti Yéesu niŋ pakakee pakan samat nii: Nikodem (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-21">3:1-21</ref></char>), aal a eekine ya <char style="w">Samali</char> (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref></char>), páhut pa piti Petusata (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 5:1-18">5:1-18</ref></char>) niŋ aŋa epukee ya te acukantoo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 9:1-41">9:1-41</ref></char>). Ti kakalaŋan ka kiteyoo, Yéesu naasok akina ayem paliyal pa empa mpuwufan pa eloŋ ya (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 6:35">6:35</ref></char>); akina ayem afaasa ya eenape ya (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 10:11">10:11</ref></char>); akina ayem lompo ecaaŋ ya eti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">8:12</ref></char>). Fiyuu Yéesu náayisane pakan paka akina ayem ayme.</para>
  <para style="ip">Saŋ náakup ta Yéesu afaakatan mah emme kati akaay pati Paapaa ateyoo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 14:28">14:28</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 16:5-10">16:5-10</ref></char>). Eehuu hiwune Yéesu náakup niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo náayisanii waah ewwa nkañaŋe wa íhinu niŋ akina aneetaat le (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 15:22-27">15:22-27</ref></char>). Naaluum Pútuun pa kiti pinapana pa pakateyoo naañomanii Paapaa ateyoo (17).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pale, Saŋ, Máciya, Mark niŋ Luk, ti waah wa ewwa nkasoke wa, taakaataak weemeeŋe weenakoole (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 18-19">18–19</ref></char>). Asokaasok akina ayem Añii ya aŋa Pútuun pa mpúpoñii ya ti púlunta pa (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 5:38">5:38</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 6:29">6:29</ref></char>); aŋa álafiye kameye Paapaa ateyoo, niŋ akina anapaa teyoo, áfaameyiyoo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 14:6">14:6</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 16:26">16:26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="is">Kikee kilim</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Inci yem</char> - Naakalaŋaa púkoo ya, aafacuk Yéesu nasok faŋoo tan óo tan: “Inci yem”, samat nii: “Inci yem afaasa ya eenape ya,” niŋ ekina tom: “Inci yem paliyal pa piti eloŋ ya.” Ta naasoke ta eehe, an óo an náameyi nii, hisoku naayaake nii akina Pútuun pa, kaatuko ta Pútuun pa mpupoñe ta <char style="w">Móyiis</char> pati Amansa ya ati <char style="w">Esipt</char>, mpusokoo nii: “Caacawam, 'Inci Yem'.”</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Hilim ha</char> - Ta Saŋ naasoke ta “Hilim ha héeyenoonii ha an,” niŋ Yéesu naayem.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Kunuu</char> - Pikee pa niŋ Saŋ asokaa Kunuu, ekina eyem <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> (6:63), pale pikee pa lompo Kunuu ka keenape ka tom. Niŋ Yéesu asokaa: “Pútuun pa Kunuu” (4:24), aŋa náalafiye ya hisoku eyem: Pútuun pa pucukantee, kaatuko an tom.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Púlunta pa</char> - Púlunta pa, pikina piyem dúniyaa ya. Ti ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyya Saŋ naakiice ya, pakan paka pakati púlunta pa, poko kayem kéeyinanut ka nii Yéesu Añii ya ati Pútuun pa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fa púkoo ya neekiicee fa:</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref>
    </char> Hilim ha héeyenoonii ha An.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="JHN 1:19-34">1:19-34</ref>
    </char> Káatuunan ka kiti Saŋ-Patis.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="JHN 1:35-51">1:35-51</ref>
    </char> Yéesu naamamal pinapana pa pakateyoo pákayaañ paka.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="JHN 2:1-11:57">2:1–11:57</ref>
    </char> Yéesu náahin píyisan piyema isak niŋ súsupak.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="JHN 12:1-19:42">12:1–19:42</ref>
    </char> Yéesu lóokuŋ ya eteyoo ekelan ya le t’etaam, le niŋ éfikahinoo kíiti nkamukoo.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">20:1-10</ref>
    </char> Yéesu náalitoonii ti eket ya.</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="JHN 20:11-21:25">20:11–21:25</ref>
    </char> Yéesu náafulii ti pinapana pa pakateyoo.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Hilim ha héeyenoonii ha An</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ti púcook pa, Hilim ha hitaakaataako. Hilim ha hiyenaayeno niŋ Pútuun pa, Hilim ha hiyem lompo Pútuun pa. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Nihiyeno niŋ Pútuun pa ti púcook pa. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Pínapii teeho Pútuun pa mpíhine waah óo waah, waah úhinutee puson eteeho. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Teeho eloŋ ya neeyem, oom eloŋ eyem lompo ecaaŋ ya eti pakan paka. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ecaaŋ ya uyya ti hicaaŋu ti énimaan ya, pale énimaan ya eyinaat yo iheeku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom “eyinaat yo kameye.”</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Pútuun pa mpúpoñii áyiin aŋa nkasok <char style="w">Saŋ</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saŋ aŋe Saŋ-Patis, neetaat Saŋ eekiice ya púkoo eyye.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Akéyyookey kati ayeno eetantake ya naakaman pakan paka kiti ecaaŋ ya, ancuk pínapii teyoo pakan paka púlooŋ nkáyinan. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Akina himuumoo aneetaat ecaaŋ ya pale ákeyyookey kati ayeno eetantake ya naakaman pakan paka kiti ecaaŋ ya. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Ecaaŋ eyyuu eyem ecaaŋ ya eti pánipani ya eyya necaaŋan pakan paka púlooŋ. Oom ecaaŋ ékeyii ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Hilim ha hiyenaayeno ti púlunta pa, pínapii teeho Pútuun pa mpiliile púlunta pa, pale púlunta pa pímiit ho. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Lateeho níhikeyii, pakan eteeho kawananut ho. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Pale pakakee nkawanan Hilim ha nkáyinan ti caacaw eteeho; oom pakan, Hilim ha níhihinii kápiyini éyenoonii epuuk Pútuun. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Kaneetaat epuuk Pútuun ti hipukuyee ha hiteyii niŋ fotom ti pálafi pa piti pupukayii, pale epuuk Pútuun kaatuko Pútuun pa puwufanii eloŋ éeyeeni.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Hilim ha níhiyenoonii an naakin noonii, an éeyisane panap niŋ tooñaa fo muus. Ucukaacuk hamake ha hiteyoo, hamake eeha Paapaa ya Pútuun pa mpuwufane ha Añii etempo oonool a kóŋ.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Saŋ átuunanaa-túunan kiteyoo, naaceek apusok: “Ehe aŋa inci ínkupe ya kiteyoo ta inci insoke ta: 'Oopa ti ékey pusonam, pale ahaŋaam hitaaku nafaa kaatuko ataakaataako inci táakumo.'”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Unaa, ti panap pa piteyoo penfakat pa, naasampan unaa púlooŋ, nene apenan apisampan unaa. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kaatuko <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> ti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> níhinapii, pale panap pa niŋ tooñaa ya ti Yéesu Krista mpínapii. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />An ataapala acuk Pútuun pa. Pale Añii ya oonool a kóŋ eeyem ya Pútuun pa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Pale Pútuun pa poonool pa kóŋ, pikina piyem hikaw Paapaa ya Pútuun pa, pikina lompo píyisane po unaa.”</char></note> akina ayem hikaw Paapaa ya Pútuun pa, akina lompo áyisane po unaa.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti Saŋ-Patis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ehe eeha <char style="w">Saŋ</char> naasoke ha ta nkacakanoo ta akina ayem ayme. Oom hinoom, pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa pakati <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> nkapoñ pakakee ti <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena</char> pa pakati Pútuun pa niŋ pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Asísikana puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa">písisikana puwaaseena</char> kapicakan Saŋ: “Awe yem ayme?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Saŋ náakup picaaŋ cataŋ, apookutii kañahan pale naasokii píhiini hat nii: “Inci neetaat <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Nkacakanoo: “Ooto awe yem ayme? Awe yem <char style="w" lemma="Elí ayaamakoola ya">Elí</char>?” Saŋ naañahanii: “Haani inci neetaat akina.” Nkacakanoo: “Awe yem <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya?” Naañahanii: “Haani.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Fiye nkasokoo: “Ooto awe yem ayme? Unii uñaŋaa kañahan kéepoñii ka unii. Weyme aafasok kitii?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Saŋ naañahanii: “Inci yem aŋa naceek a ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>: <char style="qt">'Nicoonanool pítin pa piti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>!'</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Esayi 40:3</ref></char></note> samat nii fa ayaamakoola ya <char style="w">Esayi</char> naasoke fa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ti kéepoñiyee ka ti Saŋ, intaak <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom “Inhemool kéepoñiyee ka púlooŋ ti Saŋ Pufalisaay,”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Nkacakanoo: “Awe, niŋ aaneetaat Eenucee ya, aaneetaat lompo Elí niŋ fotom ayaamakoola ya, ooto weyme uwune ánninhin <char style="w">pátise</char> pakan paka?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Saŋ naañahanii: “Inci niŋ man ínhin pátise pale ti pututa aluu taakaataak an aŋa ínnimiit. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Oom an áfaakey pusonam, inci túuniit fala kákopin ñikopu ña ñiti pisamata pa piteyoo.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Eehuu púlooŋ nihitaako ti saatee ya eti Betani pa caanak ca íncifulii pa ti musuu ma miti Jordan, pa Saŋ naayeniye pa íhinu pátise.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu, Císaacii ca citi Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Eti kacom eteyyo, <char style="w">Saŋ</char> naacuk Yéesu ti ékey teyoo naasok: “Nisincan, ehe Císaacii ca citi Pútuun pa, enca íncifulan ca umuuyen wa uti pakan paka. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Kiteyoo inci iyyeniye káakup ta inci insoke ta nii: 'Ayíin oopa ti ékey pusonam pale ahaŋaam hitaaku nafaa kaatuko ataakaataako inci táakumo.' <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Inci míitoo hínum pale kati áyisanee pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> ewune inci ínkey íhinu <char style="w">pátise</char> niŋ man.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Saŋ nene ákup picaaŋ cataŋ naasok: “Inci cukaacuk <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkúfulii patiila nkúwanoonii samat nii hícuucuuku, nkiyeno teyoo. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Inci míitoo hínum, pale aŋa éepoñiyaam ya íhinu pátise niŋ man asokaam: 'Aŋa ankaakaay a hicuku Kunuu ka keenape ka nkúwanoonii teyoo nkiyeno teyoo, aŋuu akaakaay pátise niŋ Kunuu ka keenape ka.'” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Saŋ nene asok: “Cukaacuk ho, ínkup kiti eeha inci incuke ha insok nii, akina ayem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu pinapanayoo pákayaañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Eti kacom eteyyo, <char style="w">Saŋ</char> nene ayeno toko kasiiŋ niŋ pákasupak ti pinapana pa pakateyoo. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Ta Yéesu naamuuse ta, Saŋ naasincanoo naasok: “Aha Císaacii ca citi Pútuun pa!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Pinapana pa pákasupak paka pakati Saŋ, ta nkásiye ta kilim enkuu nkanapan Yéesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yéesu naayeso naacukii ti kanapanoo naacakanii: “Weyme inniyem ti hiŋes?” Nkañahanoo: “Rabi” (ekina eyem “Akalaŋana eemaka”), “peyme ankine?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Naañahanii: “Níkey efinicuk.” Nkakaay nkacuk la naakine la, máamun ta incisape ta eyam, nkahankanool hinoom ha neyoo.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Aŋa nkasok a Andre, Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char> atuwoo, akee ti pákasupak paka kéesiye ka kilim ka kiti Saŋ nkanapan Yéesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Náatikin apicaasok púnuwoo Simon: “Ucukaacuk Mesi ya” (ekina eyem “<char style="w">Eenucee ya</char>”). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Naacoop Simon pati Yéesu. Yéesu naasincanoo naasokoo: “Awe yem Simon, Saŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saŋ aŋe aneetaat Saŋ-Patis, neetaat lompo Saŋ <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">apoñapoñ</char> a eekiice ya púkoo eyye.</char></note> añiinoo, pale fiye aafasokee Kefas” (ekina eyem “énankiin”. Ti kaŋ ya eti Kilek, Kefas ekina eyem “Piyeer”.)<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu kaayonkal ka kiteyoo Filip niŋ Natanayel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Eti kacom eteyyo Yéesu naasiiŋo pikaayu <char style="w">Galilee</char>, naakaay apipaakool niŋ <char style="w">Filip</char>, naasokoo: “Nápaniyam!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />(Oom Filip ati Petesayit, saatee ya eti Andre niŋ <char style="w">Piyeer</char>.) <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Púful toko, Filip naakaay apipaakool niŋ Natanayel naasokoo: “Ucukaacuk aŋa <char style="w">Móyiis</char> naakiice ya kiteyoo ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char>, aŋa <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa nkakiice ya kiteyoo lompo. Akina ayem Yéesu ati Naasalet, añii ya ati <char style="w">Josef</char>.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanayel naasokoo: “Fo waah weenape úyiniyini éfulii Naasalet?” Filip naañahanoo: “Kéy, aafacuk.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Ta Yéesu naacuke ta Natanayel ti élohiyoo náakup kiteyoo naasok: “Ehe ati <char style="w">Israyel</char> pánipani, kincaam kineetaat teyoo.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanayel naacakanoo: “Puume ammeyaam?” Yéesu naasokoo: “Filip áyonkalumi, cukuucuk ta ayyeniye ta t’etaam enuun sootoo ya.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Fiye Natanayel naasokoo: “Rabi, awe yem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa, awe yem Amansa ya ati Israyel!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Fo áayinanaayinan kamma inci insokuu nii cukuucuk t’etaam enuun sootoo ya? Aafancuk waah wenfakat pihaŋ le.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Nene apenan ti hisoku: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, efinicuk patiila mpánkinee, <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa piti Pútuun pa mpiyeno pisilo niŋ éwanoonii ti inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:10-17">Púcook 28:10-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Kayesan ka kiti Yéesu man elaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Eti tanta eteyyo, intaako pinimo ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char> ti saatee ya eti Kana. Yéesu íññaa ateyoo naayeno toko. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yéesu lompo naayonkalee niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Fiye elaan ya neepa, Yéesu íññaa ateyoo naasokoo: “Elaan ya epayaapa.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Pale Yéesu naañahanoo: “Aaluu, weyme uwune ansokam eehuu? Caanak ca citoom ciloot cícolii.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Iññáa ateyoo naasok píhina pa: “Níhin waah óo waah ewwa naasoke aluu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Toko, intaak sipala siti pínankiin seewucee siyema isak niŋ yoonool, nenso <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkásikool kati nkakuulanoolo. Epala óo epala éyiniyini kayekan máamun siliital áwii epaakiil (80) puwant keme niŋ áwii (120). <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Fiye Yéesu naasok píhina pa: “Nimeeŋan pipala pa niŋ man.” Nkameeŋan po tuk. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Yéesu naasokii: “Nikaas innica niwufan áhampaatiin a ati píhina pa.” Nkáhin fo. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Ahámpaatiin a ati píhina pa naasiikan man ma meeyesanee ma elaan, ámiit peyme néefulii pale píhina pa kéeyookii ka man ma kámeyimeyi. Fiye náayonkalii asaya ya <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />naasokoo: “Pakan paka púlooŋ ti elaan éesuume ya nkácook; niŋ kákumanaa, conko káfulanii éesuumut ya. Pale awe immank éesuume ya fo fiye.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Eehuu hiyeniye píyisan pa púcook pa empa Yéesu náahine pa. Náahin oom píyisan píyaañ ti mah ma miti Galilee ti saatee ya eti Kana. Fiyuu Yéesu náayisane hamake ha hiteyoo, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkáyinan teyoo.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Púful toko naawano ti saatee ya eti <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char> niŋ íññaa ateyoo, pakatuwoo niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo pale afiyiit po, máamun lóokuŋ.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu hiyaanu ha hiteyoo hiti punoomana pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Pahaaño pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa empa nkasok pa <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char> mpúlohanii, Yéesu naasilo <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Naatook ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> punoomana síis, písaacii niŋ kúcuucuuku, niŋ lompo <char style="w" lemma="Afáliŋa mañ">púfaliŋa mañ</char> keeyeniye ti pitaapul pa piteyii. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Fiye naamemanool hisawut hiti ñikopu, hikina naacoope apiyaanii poko púlooŋ ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya niŋ lompo písaacii pa niŋ síis sa. Naahancalool mañ ma miti púfaliŋa pa naahalapal pitaapul pa mpunowal. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Naasok punoomana kúcuucuuku ka: “Nífulan aŋe púlooŋ le! Timpi níhin ekumpaan ya eti Paapaa atoom ekumpaan énoomanuma!”<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Pinapana pa pakateyoo nkánawuno heekiicee ha ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>, hisok: <char style="qt">“Pálafi empa inci íllafiye pa ekumpaan ya etii, efipumukam.”</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Kícimu 69:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Fiye, pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa nkacakanoo: “Eeha ayyem ha fiyuu ti íhinu, empeyme píyisan áafahin aakati yísan unii nii aañaŋaañaŋ ho íhinu?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Nihancalool ekumpaan eyye, kunoom kíhaaciil inci nene litan yo.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Nkasokoo: “Ekumpaan ya enfakat eyye ti sitiil áwii ésupak niŋ isak niŋ yoonool (46) neelutee, awe insok nii aafalitan yo ti kunoom kíhaaciil?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Pale ekumpaan eyya Yéesu naayemii ya ti hisoku eyem eniinoo. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Po hátikin, ta Yéesu náalitoonii ta ti eket ya, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkánawuno nii asokaasok ho hínum, nkáyinan ti heekiicee ha ti hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa niŋ ti kilim enka mpaasok ka.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ta Yéesu naayeniye ta Jerusalem ti kunoom ka kiti pahaaño pa piti Himuusu ha, hícump pakan nkacuk píyisan pa peemeeŋe empa naayeniye pa íhinu, nkáyinan teyoo. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Pale Yéesu, ahintiitii kaatuko ámeyimeyi pakan paka púlooŋ. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Asoolahut eetantake ápukupoo kiti pakan paka kaatuko akina himuumoo ámeyimeyi heeyem ha ti saanii.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ Nikodem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Intaak áyiin aŋa nkasok Nikodem ati kayoŋ ka kiti <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa, akee ti pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Hikee hánant, náakey ti Yéesu naasokoo: “Rabi, úmeyimeyi nii Pútuun pa púpoñiyuu aakati kalaŋan unii, kaatuko an ayinaat íhinu píyisan empa ánhin pa niŋ Pútuun pa pineetaat neyoo.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yéesu naañahanoo apusokoo: “Inci pusoki pánipani ya, an átayini hicuku <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> taamanta apukutee nene.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ fotom “taamanta apukutee ápufulii patiila.” Moonool muu ti 3:7.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodem naañahanoo: “Puume an eemaamane áfaayiniyee hipukuyee? Fo áfaayini puñoho ti munow íññaa ateyoo kati apukee púsupiyenu?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Inci pusoki pánipani ya, an átayini pinako ti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa taamanta apukutee pínapii ti man niŋ ti <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />An pakan napuk, pale an óo an aŋa Kunuu ka keenape ka nkupuke, akina kunuu. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Aañaŋut piŋaŋo niŋ inci sokuu: 'Niñaŋee hipukuyee nene.' <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Eyam ya, pan óo pan ínsuume yo nesap, ánsi pasapal eteyyo pale áamiit peyme néefulii niŋ peyme neekaay. Fiyuu incuke ti an óo an eepukee ti Kunuu ka keenape ka.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Fiye Nikodem naacakanoo: “Puume eehuu nihiyina pitaako?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Awe eeyem ya akalaŋana éesiyye ya ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Israyel</char>, fo áamiit eehuu? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Inci pusoki pánipani ya, unii eeha nuumeya ha núukup, núutuunan eeha nuucuk ha pale háati fo fiye, aluu nisayanut hilim ha hitoonii. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Níyinanut ta inci insoke ta aluu kiti t’etaam, puume éfiniyinan niŋ inci sokaa aluu kiti patiila? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />An asiliit patiila pati Pútuun pa niŋ neetaat inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, éewanoonii ya ápufulii po. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Samat nii fa <char style="w">Móyiis</char> naacoope fa epululoola ya eesafee ya naacenk yo ti hikasap heehaane náaseepin yo ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:4-9">Pafinal 21:4-9</ref></char></note> fo lompo inci, Añii An, iññaŋee káaseepin, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />ancuk an óo an éeyinane ti inci afaataak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kaatuko Pútuun pa fiye mpílafiye <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>: pílafilafi púlunta pa fo mpuwufane Añii etempo oonool a kóŋ, ancuk an óo an éeyinane teyoo ataket pale naataak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kaatuko Pútuun pa púpoñiyoot Añii etempo ti púlunta pa kati áhin pakan paka kíiti naasiiŋanii ti pisiya, pale pakan paka kati kafakanee pínapii teyoo. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />An óo an éeyinane teyoo atasiiŋanee ti pisiya, pale an óo an éeyinanut teyoo, apayeepa kaasiiŋan ti pisiya, kaatuko áyinanut ti caacaw ca citi Añii ya oonool a kóŋ ati Pútuun pa. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Ehe heewune ha Pútuun pa mpikaakaay kaasiiŋan pakan paka ti pisiya: ecaaŋ ya ékeyyookey ti púlunta pa, pale pakan paka nkálafi énimaan ya pihaŋ ecaaŋ ya kamma páhinalii mpinaput. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />An óo an aŋa náhin heenaput anataanat ecaaŋ ya náalaaŋ yo, kaatuko afeyaafe páhinaloo timpi pucukee niŋ hanakan palaw. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Pale an óo an aŋa nanap ti pánipani ya, áfaakey ti ecaaŋ ya, ancuk pakan paka kacukaa nii, eeha náhin ha, hikina Pútuun pa mpílafiye.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ Saŋ-Patis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Púful toko, Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo nkakaay ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char>, naakampan po neyii naayeno <char style="w">pátise</char> pakan paka. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" /><char style="w">Saŋ</char> lompo naayeno pátise ti saatee ya eti Ayinon pukol saatee ya eti Salim kaatuko toko taakaataak man meemeeŋe. Pakan paka nkatowo ti ékey íhinuyee pátise. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Eehuu ta nihitaakiye ta, tempo Saŋ peeloot akulee.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Fiye, pakakee ti pinapana pa pakati Saŋ nkácook pílaacinool niŋ akee <char style="w">Asuwif</char> kiti ekuulanoolo ya eti cosaan ya eteyii. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Nkakaay pati Saŋ nkasokoo: “Sincan Rabi, áyiin a eeyeniye ya naawe ti kikee kaapii ka kiti musuu ma miti Jordan, aŋa ánkupe ya kiteyoo, akina lompo oopa ti íhinu pakan paka pátise, apan pakan paka púlooŋ unka ti pikaayu teyoo.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Saŋ naañahanii: “An ayinaat hitaaku háati waah niŋ Pútuun pa puwunutoo wo. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Aluu himuum aluu niyenaayeno keetantake ka ta inci insoke ta nii: 'Inci tom yem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa, pale inci éepoñiyee hátikinoo lamma.' <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Aal a eeyem a ti ékey pinimo, ati áyiin a eeyemoo ya ti ékey esa. Ayíin a áwiyoo, eesiiŋiye ya toko, náasi kilim asaya ya nkúsuumoo meemak. Pásuuma empuu piyem ti inci, ínsuumam pántoon. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Písiyo pa piteyoo piñaŋaa epenano, putoom pa mpíkaasino.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />“Aŋa áfulii ya patiila ahaŋa an óo an; aŋa áfulii ya t’etaam, ati t’etaam, hiti t’etaam nákup. Aŋa áfulii ya patiila, <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />eeha naacuke ha náasi, hikina nasok, pale an asayanut hilim ha hiteyoo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Aŋa áfulii ya patiila ahaŋa an óo an. Eeha naacuke ha náasi, hikina nasok, pale an asayanut hilim ha hiteyoo.” </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Aŋa nasayan ya eeha nasok ha, áyisanaayisan nii áyinanaayinan eeha Pútuun pa mpusoke ha hiti pánipani. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Kaatuko aŋa Pútuun pa mpúpoñii ya, kilim etempo nasok, kamma Pútuun pa mpuwufanoo <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> pántoon. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Paapaa ya álafilafi Añii ya naañomanoo waah óo waah. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Aŋa áyinane ti Añii ya ataakaa eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya, pale aŋa eepooke Añii ya atataak eloŋ, apan káñiken ka kiti Pútuun pa efikutowo teyoo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ aal ati Samali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Yéesu náameyi nii <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa kásiyaasi nii akina oopa ti hitaaku niŋ íhinu <char style="w">pátise</char> pinapana pihaŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(apan Yéesu tom faŋoo ayeniye íhinu pátise pale pinapana pa pakateyoo). <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Fiye, Yéesu náaful <char style="w">Judaay</char> apuñoho <char style="w">Galilee</char>. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Añaŋaa hinapu ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Samali</char>.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ti oom pítin, Yéesu naacol ti saatee ya eyya nkasok ya Sikaa ti mah ma miti Samali, pukol etaam eyya <char style="w">Jakob</char> naawune ya faw añiinoo <char style="w">Josef</char>. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6-8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6-8" />Toko ésaapun ya eti Jakob neeyem. Caanak ca ti hikaw, Yéesu naayok ti kasapal ka, naayeno pukol ésaapun ya, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkakaay ti saatee ya hinoom paliyal.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:6-8">Ti oom káayenuma, akee aal ati Samali náakey piyook. Yéesu naasokoo: “Wunam pilaan.” <verse eid="JHN 4:6-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Aal a naañahanoo: “Pale awe <char style="w">Asuwif</char> inci aal ati Samali, puume ayyinaam kaluum man?” Asokaasok eehuu kaatuko Pusuwif pa kanakanooliyantoo niŋ pakati Samali. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Niŋ aameya hínum kawun ka kiti Pútuun pa, ímmeyi eeyemuu ya ti kaluum man, awe himuumi anti luumoo man, naawuni man miti eloŋ.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Aal a naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, awe taakut nikopu apan ésaapun ya éloosaaloos. Puume áafayini hitaaku man ma miti eloŋ eyyuu? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Maamaa atoonii Jakob awufane unii ésaapun eyye, akina himuumoo le nalaan hínum, niŋ epuukoo niŋ pukoolee pa piteyoo. Fo an puume ancoke faŋi? Fo awe haŋoo hamake?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “An óo an aŋa nalaan man emme, pálaani efinene pucokoo, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />pale an óo an aŋa eelaane man emma inci uwwunoo ma, pálaani etinene pucokoo fo cancowiyaaw: man emma inci uwwunoo ma efimiyeno teyoo káapun kenfakat keekaakaayoo kawufan eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Aal a naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, wunam ti man emmuu ancuk pálaani etinene pucokam, etinene wasoolo ékey piyook le man.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Kaay cáayonkalii áyiini íññohoonii le.” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Aal a naañahanoo: “Inci taakut áyiin.” Yéesu naasokoo: “Aasokaasok páni fa ansoke fa nii aataakut áyiin. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kaatuko pákayiin isak antaake hínum apan aŋa ayyem ya fiye neyoo áyiini tom. Páni ansoke.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Aal a naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, inci cukaa nii awe <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char>. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Símaama unii, ti tíntiŋ eyye nkaluum Pútuun pa, pale aluu Pusuwif pa innisok nii, la ñaŋee la kaluum Pútuun pa yem <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Aaluu, yínanam, caanak unca ti ékey, etinene niluum Paapaa ya ti tíntiŋ eyye lamma niŋ ekina tom Jerusalem. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Aluu pakati Samali inniluumluum aŋa ínnimiit, unii Pusuwif pa nuuluum aŋa nuumeya, kaatuko ti Pusuwif pa Pútuun pa éfipinapii kati pifakan pakan paka. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Pale caanak unca ti ékey cícoliyoocol fala, ta sempe sa siti <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> niŋ siti tooñaa ya éfisihin pakan paka kápiyenoonii puluuma pánipani pakati Paapaa ya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Pale caanak unca ti ékey cícoliyoocol fala, ta puluuma pánipani efinkaluum Paapaa ya ti kunuu niŋ ti tooñaa, kaatuko payenkuu kayem puluuma pa payenka Paapaa ya naayem ka ti hiŋes.”</char></note> kaatuko payenkuu kayem puluuma pa payenka Paapaa ya naayem ka ti hiŋes. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Pútuun pa, kunuu; sempe sa siti Kunuu ka keenape ka niŋ siti tooñaa ya, sikina lamma síyina íhinu pakan paka kápiyenoonii puluuma pánipani.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Pútuun pa, kunuu, payenka efikaluum po pa kañaŋaa po kaluum ti kunuu niŋ ti tooñaa.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Aal a naasokoo: “Méyimeyi nii Mesi ya aŋa nkasok a lompo <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa oopa ti ékey. Niŋ ákeyyoo afaakaman unii waah óo waah.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Inci eeyem a fiye ti káakup naawe, inci yem akina.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma, pinapana pa pakati Yéesu nkáñohoonii, ínnimii ta nkacukoo ta ti káakup niŋ aal. Pale háati oonool teyii acakanutoo: “Weyme állafiye?” niŋ ekina tom: “Weyme uwune áyyemi ti káakup niŋ aal aŋe?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Fiye, aal a naakat toko élumpa ya eteyoo naañoho ti saatee ya naasok pakan paka: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Níkey nipisincan akee áyiin eesokaam waah wa púlooŋ ewwa inci ínhine wa. Fo áyiniyini piyeno Eenucee ya?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Fiye nkáfulii ti saatee ya nkakaay pati Yéesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Eehuu púlooŋ ti pitaako, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkaŋiiniyoo nkasokoo: “Rabi, li waah!” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Pale naañahanii: “Inci taakaataak paliyal piti hili empa aluu ínnimiit.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Pinapana pa pakateyoo nkayeno picakanool: “Fo an ákeyyookey apuwunoo paliyal?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Paliyal pa putoom piyem íhinu héesuume ha éepoñiyaam ya, impa páhin empa naawufanaam pa. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Fo nisokantoo: 'Le niŋ kiim kipaakiil efuumaañaa'? Pale inci insok: níhaafin, innisincan ukit wa, útuuniyaa kaamaañ! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Aŋa namaañ a oopa ti hisayu cooy ya eteyoo, naaconcenool paliyal, pikina piyem pakan paka keeyem ka ti ékey ti eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya. Ancuk aŋa nasuk a niŋ aŋa namaañ a efikataak pásuuma ti coonool. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kusoku enke kiti páni: 'Akee nasuk akee naamaañ.' <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Inci poñe aluu nipimaañ kaakit enka ínnihinut. Pakakee káhine ko, aluu innimaañ páhin pa piteyii.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Hícump pakati Samali keekine ka ti oom saatee nkáyinan ti Yéesu kamma aal a naasokii: “Asokaamsok eeha púlooŋ inci ínhine ha.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ekina ewune pakati Samali ta nkacole ta pati Yéesu nkaluumoo apiyeno neyii, Yéesu naayeno neyii kunoom kúsupak. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Kéeyinane ka teyoo nkahaŋ toko nkameeŋe meemak kamma kilim ka kiteyoo, <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />nkasok aal a: “Fiye úyinanutoo kamma eeha ansoke ha unii pale kamma unii faŋ unii núusiyoo, núumeyi nii akina ayem <char style="w">Afakana</char> ya pánipani ya ati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan kiti akampaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Kunoom ka kúsupak enkuu kupumuus, Yéesu náaful toko naañoho <char style="w">Galilee</char>. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Akina himuumoo mpaasok: “<char style="w">Ayaamakoola</char> ámakiyanantee ti saatee ya eteyoo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Fiye ta naacole ta Galilee, pakati toko nkawananoo kaatuko poko lompo kakaayaakaay pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char> <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> nkacuk eeha púlooŋ naayeniye ha íhinu ti pahaaño pa.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Púful toko, Yéesu náañohoonii Kana eti Galilee pa naayesane pa man ma elaan. Intaak áhampaatiin áhina ati amansa ya aŋa añiinoo akampaani éekuuñe ti saatee ya eti <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char>. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ta náasiye ta nii Yéesu áfuliyooful <char style="w">Judaay</char> ápucolii Galilee, naakaay teyoo naaluumoo apuwano Kafaanawum káakuuñan akampaani ya ateyoo eeyem ya ti putum eket. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Taamanta nicukut píyisan niŋ weecukantee étiniyinan púlay!” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Ahína ya naañahanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, wano niŋ inci le niŋ añiinam afaaket!” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Kaay, añiini afaaloŋ.” Ayíin a náayinan hilim eeha Yéesu naasokoo ha, naakaay. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ta naayeniye ta puñoho, pimiikan pa pakateyoo nkapaakoolanoo nkasokoo: “Añiini oopa kaloŋa!” <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Naacakanii: “Teyme naafisake?” Nkañahanoo: “Hukan papayal hili kawaay pasowe-eniinoo mpifisake.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Paapaa ya náapannum nii, tempo Yéesu naasokoo nii: “Añiini afaaloŋ.” Fiye akina niŋ miin ma miteyoo púlooŋ nkáyinan ti Yéesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Eehuu hiyeniye píyisan pa púsupiyenu pa empa Yéesu náahine pa Galilee, ta náañohoonii ta ápufulii Judaay.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yéesu káakuuñan ka kiteyoo éehute ya ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Púful toko Yéesu naasilo <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> kamma pikee pahaaño piti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char>. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Po Jerusalem, pukol Putum pa piti Písaacii pa, intaak éwacuma eelutee neetaak sícimpaŋ isak, eyya neyonkalee “Petusata” ti kaŋ ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Ahiburu">Hiburu</char>. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Ti oom pícimpaŋ pakan keemeeŋe kéekuuñe nkahinto: kéefuume, kéehute niŋ payenka nkanow niŋ efank.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">An ámiit man <char style="w">Saŋ</char> lompo akiice fiye: “Hítuulu nkayeniye man ma kati muwenee. <char style="fv">4</char> Kaatuko <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eti Pútuun neloom ékey neewen man ma. Niŋ epayaa mo hiwenu, aŋa náyaañ a apinako ti man ma nákuuñanee-kúuñan, ti káakuuñu óo káakuuñu enka naataake.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Intaak toko áyiin éehute fo sitiil áwii niŋ kaat niŋ síhaaciil (38).<verse eid="JHN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yéesu naacukoo la naahintiye la, náasi nii afiyyaa ti oom pacuk naasokoo: “Aálafilafi kafisak?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Eéhute ya naañahanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, taakut an eekaakaayam kámocan ti éwacuma ya niŋ man ma muwenee. Niŋ inci yeniyaa pikaayu, cólum, akee náatikinam.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Lito! Coop kahun ka kitii inkaay.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Tokotoko áyiin a náakuuñanee, náaseepin kahun ka kiteyoo náayaañ pikaayu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Eehuu ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> hiti Pusuwif pa nihitaakiye. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Ekina ewune pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa nkasok áyiin a éekuuñanee ya: “Fíyooy hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka, aañaŋut káaseepin kahun ka kitii.” <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Pale naañahanii: “Ayíin a éekuuñanaam a asokaam: 'Coop kahun ka kitii inkaay.'” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Nkacakanoo: “Ayme áyiin asokuu: 'Coop kahun ka kitii inkaay'?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Pale éekuuñanee ya ámiit oom an kaatuko pakan paka kameeŋaameeŋ apan Yéesu naapuuto.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Po hátikin, Yéesu naatook áyiin a ti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> naasokoo: “Síitan! Aákuuñanee-kúuñan, timpi nene muuyen ancuk heehaŋe luu timpi hitaakiyi.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Púful toko, áyiin a naacaasok pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa nii Yéesu ákuuñanoo. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ekina ewune pakati kikaw ka nkáyaañ kaakallan Yéesu kamma naayeniye íhinu enkuu ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Pale Yéesu naañahanii: “Paapaa atoom oopa ti páhin fo fiye, inci lompo oopa ti páhin.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Pañahanal empuu puwune pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa nkahaŋ toko nkaŋese fa efikamuk Yéesu. Kaatuko Yéesu átuulut hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka, apan naasok nii Pútuun pa faafoo, apilehoolan faŋoo niŋ Pútuun pa.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawufanee Añii ya ati Pútuun pa kayine kiti íhinu kíiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yéesu naañahan pakati kikaw ka: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, Añii ya ayinaat íhinu waah faŋoo pale eeha nacuk ha ti Paapaa ya, kaatuko eeha Paapaa ya náhin ha, hikina Añii ya lompo náhin. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Paapaa ya álafilafi Añii ya, náyisanoo eeha púlooŋ náhin ha. Afánayisanoo lompo weecukantee weehaŋe pafom ewwa inniyem wa fiye ti hicuku, ancuk aluu niŋaŋiyaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Samat nii fa Paapaa ya nalitan fa keekete ka naawufanii eloŋ ya, fo lompo Añii ya naawufan eloŋ ya aŋa náalafiye ya. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Apan Paapaa ya áhinantoo kíiti an, pale Añii ya naakate kati áhin kíiti, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />ancuk pakan paka púlooŋ kati kámakiyan Añii ya, samat nii fa nkámakiyan fa Paapaa ya. Aŋa éemakiyanut a Añii ya, ámakiyanut lompo Paapaa ya éepoñiyoo ya.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, aŋa éesiye hilimam náayinan aŋa éepoñiyaam ya, ataakaa eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya, átahinee kíiti pale áfuliyooful ti eket ya apinako ti eloŋ ya. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, caanak unca ti ékey cícoliyoocol fala, ta keekete ka éfikasi hilim ha hiti Añii ya ati Pútuun pa, apan keekaakaay ho ka hísiyu efikaloŋ. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Samat nii fa Paapaa ya naayekane fa eloŋ ya ti himuumoo fo lompo naawufane Añii ya apiyekan eloŋ ya ti himuumoo. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Naawufanoo kayine kiti íhinu kíiti kamma naayem <char style="w">Añii An</char>. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Timpi niŋaŋo kamma eehuu, kaatuko caanak unca ti ékey ta keeyem ka púlooŋ ti kiyaak ka éfikasi hilimoo, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />nkálitoonii ti eket ya. Kéehine ka heenape ha éfikalitoonii ti eket ya nkataak eloŋ ya, kéehine ka heenaput ha éfikalitoonii ti eket ya nkasiiŋanee ti pisiya.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Inci himuumam yinaat íhinu waah, eeha inci ínsiye ha ti Paapaa atoom inci nínhin kíiti. Páhinalam kíiti peecoonoole kaatuko ŋesut héesuumaam ha pale héesuume ha éepoñiyaam ya.”<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keetantake ka pakati Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Yéesu nene asokii: “Niŋ inci yeniyaa eetantake ya ati faŋam, eeha inci insok ha hiti pánipani tom. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Akee ayeniye eetantake ya atoom, méyimeyi nii eeha naasoke ha kutoom hiti páni. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Aluu, innipoñ pakan ti <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, akina eetantake ya atoom naasok pánipani ya. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Iyyema inci, soolahut an apiyeno eetantake ya atoom pale sokaasok enkuu kati nifakanee. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Saŋ acukaacuk samat nii lampi eecaaŋanee picaaŋ cataŋ, ínsuum aluu hínum ti kakalaŋan ka kiteyoo ti caanak ceetama. Pakalaŋanal empuu pucukaacuk nii ecaaŋ enfakat. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Pale iyyema inci, taakaataak waah weetantake kutoom pihaŋ eeha Saŋ naasoke ha kutoom, ukina uyem weecukantee ewwa Paapaa ya naawufanaam wa píhin, íyyemi wo ti íhinu. Pikina mpíyisan nii Paapaa ya ápoñiyaam. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Paapaa ya éepoñiyaam ya, akina himuumoo ayem eetantake ya atoom. Pale nitaapala nísi hilimoo, niŋ fotom hicuku himuumoo. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Hilim ha hiteyoo hikinut ti saan aluu kaatuko níyinanut aŋa náapoñii ya. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Innikalaŋkalaŋ pinap <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> kaatuko aluu nímiiloolaa-míilool nii tenko efinitaak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya, ántuŋ kilim enkuu kutoom nkúkupe. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Pale innipook ékey ti inci kati nitaak eloŋ ya.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Soolahut hímulu hiti pakan. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Pale méyimeyi aluu, nílafiit Pútuun pa. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Ti caacaw Paapaa atoom inci ínkeyii, nisayanutam. Niŋ akee ákeyyoo ti caacaw faŋoo efinisayanoo. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />An óo an oopa ti hiŋes kámakiyan kéefulii ti áwiyoo, pale niŋesut kámakiyan ka kéefulii ka ti Pútuun pa poonool pa. Fiye, puume éfiniyiniyam káyinan? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Timpi nímiilool nii inci fayeno anooka ya ataaluu hátikin Paapaa ya, anooka ya ataaluu ayem <char style="w">Móyiis</char> aŋa ínnihine ya cíki. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Niŋ níyinanaayinan Móyiis, anti níyinanam kaatuko kutoom naakiice. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Pale niŋ níyinanut eeha naakiice ha, puume éfiniyini káyinan hilimam?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Káakuuman ka kiti Yéesu pákayiin síwuli isak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Eehuu hipimuus, Yéesu naafiitan ti ekee ekink ya eti han ha hiti <char style="w">Galilee</char>. Oom han nihisokee lompo han ha hiti Tipeliyas. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Kayoŋ kenfakat nkiyeniyoo kanapan kaatuko pakan paka kacukaacuk weecukantee ewwa naayeniye wa íhinu ti kéekuuñe ka. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Púful toko, Yéesu naasilo ti tíntiŋ niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo nkayeno. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Tempo <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char> níhilohanii, pahaaño pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yéesu naasincan naacuk kayoŋ kenfakat keeyeniyoo kanapan. Fiye, naacakan <char style="w">Filip</char>: “Peyme éfuuyiniyaa hinoom kúmpuul pakan paka payenke púlooŋ kati kali?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Asokaasok eehuu kati awinko Filip kaatuko akina himuumoo ámeyimeyi eeha naakaakaay ha íhinu. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filip naañahanoo: “Háati niŋ cooy eti kiim isak niŋ hoonool etefom an óo an kati áyini hitaaku címpuul.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Akee ti pinapana pa pakateyoo aŋa nkasok a Andre, Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char> atuwoo, naasokoo: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Ehe cikee cikampaani ceetaake kúmpuul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kúmpuul ka enka <char style="w">Saŋ</char> naasoke ka kiyem “kúmpuul kiti barley” (ti ankale kaŋ) niŋ ekina tom “kúmpuul kiti orge” (ti falans kaŋ). Ti oom caanak, aŋuu kúmpuul kiti pakan keeleke. </char></note> isak niŋ moon músupak. Fo efifom pakan paka púlooŋ?” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yéesu naasokii: “Níhinii kapiyeno poko púlooŋ.” La nkayeniye la, kaameeŋ píheeni, nkayeno tempo. Pákayiin máamun síwuli isak (5,000) kayeniye toko. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yéesu naacoop kúmpuul ka, naasok Pútuun pa apalaka, náapaacinool ko keeyeniye ka toko, náahin fo lompo moon ma, nkali fo kasiit.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ta nkaliye ta poko púlooŋ fo kafoman, Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Niyesal mífiitiin ma meetowiye ma miti kúmpuul ka ancuk waah úmpuupuco.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Nkayesal, nkameeŋan síyya ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak ti pútowontiin pa piti kúmpuul ka isak ya enka nkaliye ka.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Pakan paka kapucuk heecukantee eeha Yéesu naayeniye ha íhinu, nkáyaañ hisoku: “Pánipani, áyiin a aŋe ayem <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya eeñaŋe ya ékey ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Pale Yéesu náameyi nii éfikahinoo amansa ti sempe, nene añako pati tíntiŋ ya lamayoo.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kasapal ka ñoota kiti Yéesu ti han ha péeseemut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Ta ínciniimiye ta, pinapana pa pakati Yéesu nkawano pati han ha. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Nkáyuuko ti piteen nkáyaañ kaafiitan han ha kapuwant <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char>. Caanak ca unca cicoke, Yéesu aloot ácolii teyii. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Hiyam henfakat níhiyaañ hisapu, kúsuu ka nkihiñ. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Pinapana pa pakati Yéesu nkákus máamun sikilomeetal isak niŋ ekina tom isak niŋ yoonool, nkaŋantan Yéesu ti ésapalii ti man ma, ápulohiiloh piteen pa, nkafe. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Pale Yéesu naasokii: “Aŋe inci, timpi nife!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Pinapana pa nkálafiyoo híyuuku ti piteen pa. Emma nkáyuukoo ma, piteen pa mpihaaŋ ti hicolu la nkañaŋe la hiciŋu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Pinapana pa nkálafiyoo híyuuku ti piteen pa pale piteen pa mpihaaŋ ti hicolu la nkañaŋe la hiciŋu.” </char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Eti kacom eteyyo, kayoŋ ka keetowiye ka ti kikee kaapii ka kiti han ha nkápannum nii piteen poonool lamma piyeniye toko, apan nkámeyi nii Yéesu áyuukiit ti piteen pa niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo, pale poko lamayii kakaaye. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Fiye ñikee ñiteen íññifulii Tipeliyas iññiciŋ pukol la pakan paka nkaliye la kúmpuul ka, ta <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> naasoke ta Pútuun pa apalaka. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ta pakan paka nkápannume ta nii Yéesu aneetaat toko, pinapana pa lompo kaneetaat toko, nkáyuuko ti ñiteen eññuu kapikaay Kafaanawum hiŋes Yéesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu, paliyal pa piti eloŋ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ta nkacole ta ti ekee ekink ya eti han ha, nkatook po Yéesu nkacakanoo: “Rabi, teyme ánkeyii le?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, hiŋesuyam inniyaake neetaat kamma innicukale píyisan pa putoom ínniyinan ti inci, pale kamma inniliye kúmpuul fo nisiit. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Paliyal empa mpúpuco, timpi puwas aluu páhin, pale níhin páhin piti paliyal empa mputowo fo eket maama piti eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya empa inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fawufan pa aluu. Kaatuko Paapaa ya eeyem a Pútuun pa píyisanaayisan nii inci mpuwufane sempe etempo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Nkacakanoo: “Weyme nuuñaŋe íhinu kati úhin eeha Pútuun pa mpílafiye ha?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Eeha Pútuun pa mpílafiye ha hiyem nípiyinan ti aŋa mpúpoñii ya.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Nkasokoo: “Fiye awe, empeyme píyisan áafahin, niŋ unii ucukaa po núuyinani? Weyme ankaakaay íhinu? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Símaama unaa kaliyaali <char style="w">manna</char> ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>, samat nii heekiicee ha ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>, hisok: <char style="qt">'Naawufanii kapili paliyal péefulii patiila.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Efúlii 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:15">Nehemiya 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Kícimu 78:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:40">105:40</ref></char></note>” <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yéesu naasokii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, <char style="w">Móyiis</char> tom awufane aluu paliyal pa péefulii pa patiila pale Paapaa atoom awufane aluu paliyal pa piti pánipani ya péefulii pa patiila. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kaatuko paliyal pa empa Pútuun pa mpuwufane pa, pikina piyem an a éefulii ya patiila naawufan eloŋ ya <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “pikina piyem péefulii pa patiila mpuwufan eloŋ ya púlunta pa.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Nkasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, wun unii hinak óo hinak ti oom paliyal.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yéesu naañahanii apusokii: “Inci yem hímpuul ha hiti eloŋ ya. An óo an éekeyii ti inci peep etipucokoo púlay. An óo an éeyinane ti inci pálaani etipucokoo púlay. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Pale samat nii fa inci insoke fa aluu: nicukaamcuk háati fo níyinanut. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Pakan paka púlooŋ payenka Paapaa ya naawufanaam ka éfikakey ti inci, an óo an éekeyii ti inci etiyaanoo pántoon. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kaatuko fúliyoot patiila kati hín héesuumaam ha pale héesuume ha éepoñiyaam ya. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Eépoñiyaam ya álafiit púpuul háati oonool ti payenka naawufanaam ka, pale pilitanii ti eket ya ti hinoom ha hikelan ha hiti púlunta pa. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kaatuko eeha Paapaa atoom náalafiye ha hiyem, pakan paka púlooŋ keecuke ka Añii ya te nkáyinanoo, oom pakan kataak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya, inci illitanii ti eket ya ti hinoom ha hikelan ha hiti púlunta pa.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Fiye <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkáyaañ káakumutool kiteyoo kamma naasoke nii: “Inci yem hímpuul ha héefulii ha patiila.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Nkasok: “Fo aŋe Yéesu tom, <char style="w">Josef</char> añiinoo, aŋa nuumeyaa ya faafoo niŋ íññaayoo? Puume áfaayini hisoku: 'Patiila inci ínfulii'?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yéesu naasokii: “Nikatan káakumutool ka! <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />An ayinaat ékey ti inci taamanta Paapaa ya éepoñiyaam ya áñakiyootoo ti inci, inci illitanoo ti eket ya ti hinoom ha hikelan ha. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Kiiceekiic ti pakiical pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa nii: <char style="qt">'Pútuun pa efipikalaŋanii poko púlooŋ.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Esayi 54:13</ref></char></note> An óo an éesiitane Paapaa ya naakalaŋ teyoo, áfaakey ti inci. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />An ataapala acuk Paapaa ya niŋ neetaat éefulii ya pati Pútuun pa; akina acuke Paapaa ya. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, an óo an éeyinane, ataakaataak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Inci yem hímpuul ha hiti eloŋ ya. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Símaama aluu kaliyaali manna ya ti káahaaŋ ka tes, háati fo nkaket. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Pale paliyal empa inci insoke pa, pikina piyem paliyal pa péewanoonii pa púpufulii patiila, an óo an eeliye po ataket. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Inci yem paliyal pa piti eloŋ ya péefulii pa patiila. An óo an eeliye ti paliyal empe afaaloŋ fo cancowiyaaw. Apan paliyal empa inci inkaakaay pa kawufan, pikina piyem eniinam. Inci fawufan po ancuk púlunta pa pitaakaa eloŋ.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Fiye Pusuwif pa nkáyaañ píñakalool penfakat nkasok: “Puume áyiin a aŋe naayina unaa kawufan eniinoo kati uliyaa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, taamanta niliit enii inci, Añii An, innilaan hísimam, etinitaak eloŋ ya. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />An óo an eeliye eniinam, naalaan hísimam ataakaataak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya, inci illitanoo ti eket ya ti hinoom ha hikelan ha. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kaatuko eniinam eyem paliyal pánipani, hísimam palaanal pánipani. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />An óo an eeliye eniinam naalaan hísimam afaakin ti inci, inci lompo inkin teyoo. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Paapaa ya éepoñiyaam ya oopa kaloŋa, inci lompo íyyemi kaloŋa kamma akina. Fo lompo incuke, an óo an eeliye eniinam afaaloŋ kamma inci. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Paliyal empa inci insoke pa, pikina piyem paliyal pa péewanoonii pa púpufulii patiila, pucukut nii empa símaama aluu nkaliye pa púful toko nkaket. An óo an eeliye paliyal empe afaaloŋ fo cancowiyaaw.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Asokaasok enke akina ti kakalaŋan ka ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya eti <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char>.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícump pinapana, kakatan ka kiteyii Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ta nkásiye ta eehuu, hícump ti pinapana pa pakateyoo nkasok: “Pakalaŋanal empuu píciiticiiti! Ayme ayina po kasayan?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yéesu náameyi ti yaanoo nii pinapana pa pakateyoo, káakumutool eeha naasoke ha nkayaake, naasokii: “Fo kilim enkuu efikiñahan aluu puson ti káyinan ka kitaaluu? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Puume facuk niŋ nicukaam, inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, ti pisilo la inci iyyeniye la? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Kunuu ka kiti Pútuun pa nkuwufan eloŋ, sempe an sitaakut nafaa. Kilim enka inci ínkup ka aluu, kiti Kunuu niŋ eloŋ. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Pale pakakee taaluu káyinanut.” Yéesu asokaasok eehuu kaatuko ámeyimeyi kápiliŋ ti púcook pa pakayme káyinanut teyoo, náameyi lompo ayme akaakaay hífulu teyoo. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Nene asokii: “Eehe hiwune inci insok aluu nii, an ayinaat ékey ti inci taamanta Paapaa ya áñakiyootoo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma hícump ti pinapana pa pakateyoo nkakatanoo, nkáyekuno pinapool neyoo. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Fiye Yéesu naacakan pinapana pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka: “Fo aluu lompo nílafiit pikaayu?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naañahanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, ti ayme nuukaakaay? Awe yekane kilim enka nkuwufan ka eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Unii úyinanaayinan, núumeyi nii, awe yem Eesampanee ya ati Pútuun pa.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Fo inci tom mamale aluu, aluu ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka? Pale háati fo, akee taaluu áhina páhin pa piti áhampaatiin a ati <char style="w" lemma="Seetaani">piseetaani</char> pa!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Kiti Judas añii ya ati Simon Iskaliyot naayeniye káakup. Kaatuko akina akaakaay hífulu teyoo apan akee ti ŋaasuwan ya niŋ pákasupak paka naayem.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Káayinanaati ka kiti Yéesu pakatuwoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Púful toko, Yéesu naafiitanool mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char>, álafiit kaafiitanool mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> kamma pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkayemoo po ti cíllopa kati kamukoo. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Tempo pahaaño pa piti Púkuut pa piti Pusuwif pa mpúlohanii. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma, Yéesu pakatuwoo nkasokoo: “Fúl le inkaay ti mah ma miti Judaay ancuk pinapana pa pakatii lompo kacukaa eeha ánhin ha! <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />An ayoliyantoo ti páhinoo niŋ álafiyaa písiyo; páawoo aapa ánhin enkuu, yísanoolo ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Yéesu pakatuwoo kasokaasok eehuu kaatuko poko lompo káyinanut teyoo. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Caanak ca citoom ciloot cícolii, pale citaaluu ca, tan óo tan citempaatempo. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Pakati púlunta pa kayinaat aluu hinatu; pale inci, kanataam-nat kamma inci insok tan óo tan nii páhinalii pinaput. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Aluu nisilo pati pahaaño pa, samat inci etisilo pati pahaaño empuu, kaatuko caanak ca citoom ciloot cícolii.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ta naapaye ta káakup naatowo Galilee.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu pati pahaaño pa piti Púkuut pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ta pakatuwoo nkakaaye ta pati pahaaño pa, Yéesu lompo naakaay po, pale naayolo ti pikaayu péeyisanooliit. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkayeniyoo hiŋes pati pahaaño pa, nkasok: “Ayíin a aŋuu uwwey?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Ti kayoŋ ka pakan paka nkayeno pupuusanool kiteyoo. Pakakee nkasok: “Aŋuu áyiin eenape.” Pakakee paka nkasok: “Haani, kincaakool pakan paka naayaake.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Pale an áhaañiit káakup kiteyoo niŋ hilim heeceeke kamma nkafeye pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ta nkayeniye ta ti pututa pahaaño pa, Yéesu naasilo pati <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> naayeno kakalaŋan ti hank ha. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa ínnimii nkasok: “Ayíin a aŋe ataapala ataak akalaŋana <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa">pakiical pa piti Pútuun pa</char>. Puume naayina kameye eehuu?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Kakalaŋan enka inci inkalaŋan ka kúfuliyoot ti inci, pale ti éepoñiyaam ya. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Niŋ an álafiyaa íhinu eeha Pútuun pa mpílafiye ha, áfaameyi man kakalaŋan ka kutoom ti Pútuun pa nkúfulii, niŋ ekina tom héefulii ti inci inci iyyem ti káakup. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />An aŋa nákup héefulii teyoo, hiŋes kánapiyan caacawoo naayaake, pale an aŋa naŋes kánapiyan caacaw éepoñiyoo ya, an ati pánipani, kincaam kineetaat teyoo. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Fo <char style="w">Móyiis</char> tom awufane aluu <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char>? Apan an taaluu átuulut ho, weyme uwune ínnilafiyam himuku?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Pakan paka nkañahanoo: “<char style="w">Hísaalumant</char> híwuuliyuu, ayme álafiyuu himuku?” <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yéesu naasokii: “Inci heecukantee hoonool inci ínhine, aluu púlooŋ ínnim aluu. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Móyiis asoke aluu <char style="w" lemma="Kanakan">ninakan</char> mikampaani ma mitaaluu niŋ mitaakaa kunoom isak niŋ kíhaaciil (apan eehuu hífuliyoot ti Móyiis pale ti símaama aluu <char style="w">Abraham</char>, <char style="w">Isaak</char> niŋ <char style="w">Jakob</char>). Kamma eeha Móyiis naasoke ha, aluu lompo pikee pa inninakan-nakan ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char>. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Páawoo inninakan-nakan mikampaani aluu háati ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka, ti hítuulu hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti Móyiis, weyme éfiniñiken ti inci kamma inci ínkuuñane enii an púmpuluŋ ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Niŋ níhinaa kíiti, timpi nisincan eeha innicuk ha lamma, pale níhin kíiti pucoonool.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fo Yéesu ayem Eenucee ya?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Pakakee ti pakati <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> nkasok: “Fo áyiin aŋe tom nkayem ti hiŋes himuku? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Nisincan, oopa ti káakup hátikin pakan paka peeyoliit, an asokutoo waah. Fo pakati kikaw ka pakatuunaa kacoonaacoon pánipani nii akina ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Antúŋ áyiin a aŋe, úmeyiyaameyi pa náafulii. Pale niŋ Eenucee ya ákeyyoo, an átameyi pa náafulii.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Tempo Yéesu naayeno kakalaŋan ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, naasokii niŋ hilim heeceeke: “Ee nímeyiyaam-méyi, ínnimeyi peyme inci ínfulii. Pale inci tom mamale ékey ya etoom, éepoñiyaam ya ati pánipani, nímiitoo. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Inci méyiyoomeyi kaatuko pateyoo inci ínfulii, akina ápoñiyaam.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Kamma kilim enkuu, nkayeno hiŋes hicokuyoo pale an anaŋut teyoo epees kaatuko caanak ca citeyoo ciloot cícolii. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Háati fo, ti kayoŋ ka, hícump níhiyinan teyoo, nkasok: “Niŋ Eenucee ya ákeyyoo, fo áfaahin hícump píyisan pihaŋ áyiin a aŋe?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kúmpoña ka kiti pufaasa pa kapucok Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkási eeha kayoŋ ka nkiyeniye ha káakumutool kiti Yéesu. Fiye <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ Pufalisaay pa nkapoñ pufaasa <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> kapica kacokoo. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Ta nkacole ta, Yéesu naasok: “Inci fayeno naaluu pale etikampan, niŋ fúlaa toko fañoho pati éepoñiyaam ya. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Efiniŋesam pale etinicukam; pa inci inkaakaay pa piyeno, aluu étiniyini po pikaayu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Fiye pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkayeno picakanool: “Peyme áyiin a aŋe naakaakaay, pa etuucukoo? Fo pati Pusuwif pa keehancalooliye ka nkakin niŋ <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>? Fo afaakalaŋan keeneetaat ka Pusuwif? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Weyme náalafiye hisoku ti pákupal empe: 'Efiniŋesam pale etinicukam; pa inci inkaakaay pa piyeno, aluu étiniyini po pikaayu'?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiyanu ka kiti man ma miti eloŋ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Hinoom ha hikelan ha hiti pahaaño pa heehaŋe ha hitaaku nafaa, Yéesu naasiiŋo naasok niŋ hilim heeceeke: “Niŋ pálaani pucokaa an, ákey ti inci apilaan. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />An óo an éeyinane ti inci,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Niŋ pálaani pucokaa an, ákey ti inci. An óo an éeyinane ti inci alaan,” </char></note> <char style="qt">'kiyanu kiti man miti eloŋ éfikifasasii ti yaanoo,'</char> samat nii fa inkiicee fa ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:3">Esayi 21:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 47:1">Esekiyel 47:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Ta Yéesu naasoke ta eehuu, kiti <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> kiti Pútuun pa naayeniye káakup, keekaakaay ka éwanoonii ti kéeyinane ka teyoo. Tempo, Kunuu ka kuloot kuwufanee, kaatuko hamake ha hiti Yéesu hiloot híyisanee.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Píkatinool pa piti pakan paka kamma Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ta nkásiye ta kilim enkuu, pakakee ti kayoŋ ka nkasok: “Pánipani áyiin a aŋe ayem <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya!” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Pakakee paka nkasok: “Akina ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa!” Pale pakakee nkasok: “Fo Eenucee ya áyiniyini éfulii <char style="w">Galilee</char>? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Fo hikiicutee ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nii, Eenucee ya áfaafulii ti miin ma miti <char style="w">Dawid</char>, ti saatee ya eti Betelehem pa Dawid naakine pa hínum?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mika 5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Fiyuu kayoŋ ka nkípaacinooliye kamma Yéesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Pakakee teyii nkálafiyoo hicoku, pale an anaŋut teyoo epees.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káayinanaati ka kiti ñíhampaatiin Pusuwif pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ti pikelan, pufaasa pa pakati <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> nkáñohoonii pati <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa, nkacakanii: “Weyme uwune nícoopiyootoo?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Pufaasa pa nkañahanii: “An ataapala ákup samat nii áyiin a aŋuu!” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Fiye Pufalisaay pa nkasokii: “Fo acaakoolaa-caakool aluu lompo? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Fo taakaataak akee ti pakati kikaw ka pakatuunaa niŋ ekina tom ti Pufalisaay pa éeyinane ti áyiin a aŋuu? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Haani! Pale kayoŋ enke kéemiit ka <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>, pakan keeñanee!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Pale Nikodem, Afalisaay ya aŋa mpaakaay ya faw pati Yéesu, naasokii: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Hilim ha hituunaa heesiiŋanee ha, fo híyiniyini kaasiiŋan an ti pisiya an péesiitanutoo náameyi eeha náahine?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Fiye nkañahanoo: “Awe, fo awe lompo ati <char style="w">Galilee</char>? Kalaŋ heekiicee ha ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>, aafacuk nii <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> átafulii Galilee.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">7:53 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">An ámiit man <char style="w">Saŋ</char> akiice 7:53–8:11.</char>
    </note> <char style="sls">[Púful toko an óo an naayet pateyoo.]</char><verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">
    <char style="it">Aal a eemintee ya ti pahaaño niŋ áyiin</char>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">An ámiit man <char style="w">Saŋ</char> akiice 7:53–8:11.</char>
    </note> <char style="sls">[Ta an óo an naayet ta ti enuufoo, Yéesu naakaay ti cítintiŋ ca enca nkasok ca Olif.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" /><char style="sls">Eti kacom eteyyo mpucom mic, naañoho ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, pakan paka púlooŋ nkayeno ékey teyoo, akina naayeno apiyeniyii kakalaŋan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" /><char style="sls"><char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">Pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkácoopii aal eenimiye aŋa nkaminte ti pahaaño niŋ áyiin, nkasiiŋanoo hátikin pakan paka púlooŋ.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" /><char style="sls">Nkasok Yéesu: “Ahámpaatiin, aal a aŋe amintee ti pahaaño niŋ áyiin.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" /><char style="sls">Ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>, kiiceekiic nii pakaal paka payenkuu fiyuu kañaŋee himuku ti <char style="w" lemma="Kaanunkal">kaanunkalee</char> niŋ pukumpa. Fiye awe, eeheyme ansoke?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" /><char style="sls">Kasokaasok eehuu kati kakuuc Yéesu nkáyiniyoo hinooku. Pale Yéesu náasitan naayeno hikiicu niŋ hisiikoo t’etaam.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" /><char style="sls">Pikalaŋana pa niŋ Pufalisaay pa nkatowiyoo ti kaacakanool, fiye Yéesu naalito naasokii: “An taaluu aŋa ataapala amuuyen, átikin anunkoo ekumpa.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" /><char style="sls">Púful toko, nene ásitan apiyeno hikiicu t’etaam.</char><verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />
    <char style="sls">Ta nkásiye ta kilim enkuu, kéecoopii ka aal a nkayeno epuutalo oonool oonool, púcook ti keefale ka fo towo Yéesu lamma niŋ aal a eesiiŋanee ya ti pututa pa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" /><char style="sls">Yéesu nene alito naacakan aal a: “Aaluu, poko unkey? Fo an asiiŋanuti ti pisiya?”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" /><char style="sls">Aal a naañahanoo: “Haani Ahámpaatiin.” Yéesu naasokoo: “Inci lompo etisiiŋani ti pisiya, kaay pale timpi nene muuyen.”]</char><verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu ecaaŋ ya eti púlunta pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yéesu nene asok pakan paka: “Inci yem ecaaŋ ya eti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>, an óo an eenapanaam ataloŋ ti énimaan pale afaataak ecaaŋ ya eyya newufan ya eloŋ ya.” <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Fiye <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkasokoo: “Awe yem eetantake ya ati faŋi, ooto eeha ansok ha hiti pánipani tom!” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Háati inci íyyemi eetantake ya ati faŋam, eeha inci insok ha hiti pánipani, kaatuko méyimeyi pa inci ínfulii niŋ pa inci iyyem ti pikaayu. Pale aluu, nímiit pa inci ínfulii, nímiit lompo pa inci iyyem ti pikaayu. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Aluu, ínnihinaa kíiti, innisincan-sincan lamma eeha nihicukee ha. Iyyema inci, hínantoo kíiti an. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Apan niŋ inci hínaa kíiti, necoonool-coonool, kaatuko yeniyantoo lamayam, pale Paapaa ya éepoñiyaam ya nayenoyeno niŋ inci. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Kiiceekiic ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hitaaluu nii, niŋ keetantake pákasupak kasokaa hoonool huu, eeha nkasoke ha hiti pánipani.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Kakaman 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Inci yem eetantake ya atoom, Paapaa ya éepoñiyaam ya ayem eetantake ya atoom lompo.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Pufalisaay pa nkacakanoo: “Paapaa atii uwwey?” Yéesu naañahanii: “Nímiitam, nímiit lompo Paapaa atoom. Niŋ nímeyiyaam-méyi, anti nímeyi Paapaa atoom lompo.” <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yéesu naasokii kilim enkuu ta naayeniye ta kakalaŋan ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, pukol la nkawas la mañ ma miti kawun ka. An acokutoo kaatuko caanak ca citeyoo ciloot cícolii.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaacempes ka kiti Yéesu kiti eket ya eteyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yéesu nene asok <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa: “Inci fakaay, efiniŋesam, pale efiniket niŋ kaamuuyen ka kitaaluu. Pa inci iyyem pa ti pikaayu, étiniyini po ékey.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Fiye, <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkasok: “Fo emukoolo naakaakaay? Kaatuko asok: 'Niyinaat pikaayu pa inci inkaakaay pa.'” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yéesu nene asokii: “Aluu pakati t’etaam, inci ati patiila; aluu pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>, inci ati púlunta pa tom. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ekina ewune inci insok aluu: 'Efiniket niŋ umuuyen wa utaaluu.' Niŋ níyinanut nii Inci Yem aŋa inci iyyem ya, efiniket niŋ umuuyen wa utaaluu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Nkañahanoo: “Fo awe yem ayme?” Yéesu naañahanii: “Aŋa inci iyyem ya aluu ti hisoku kápiliŋ ti púcook. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Hícump waah inci intaake uti hisoku kitaaluu niŋ uti íhinu aluu kíiti, pale aŋa éepoñiyaam ya ati pánipani. Eeha inci ínsiye ha teyoo, hikina inci insok púlunta pa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Kámiit nii hiti Paapaa ya naayemii ti hisoku.<verse eid="JHN 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Fiye Yéesu naasokii: “Niŋ níseepinaam,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Saŋ 3:14</ref></char></note> inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, éfinimeyi nii Inci Yem aŋa inci iyyem ya. Innímeyi lompo nii hínantoo waah inci faŋam, pale eeha Paapaa ya naakalaŋanaam ha, hikina inci insok. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Eépoñiyaam ya oopa niŋ inci, akatanutam lamayam. Kaatuko héesuumoo ha inci ínhin tan óo tan.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Ta naayeniye ta káakup kilim enkuu, hícump pakan nkáyinan teyoo.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pinapana pánipani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yéesu naasok <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa kéeyinane ka teyoo: “Niŋ nitowiyaa ti kanapan kilim ka kutoom, efiniyeno pinapana pa pakatoom pánipani. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Efínimeyi pánipani ya, apan pánipani ya efeeyihan aluu ti himiikanate.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Nkañahanoo: “Unii pakati miin ma miti <char style="w">Abraham</char>, utaapala uyeno pimiikan an. Fiye awe, puume áafayini hisoku unii nii: 'Efiniyihanee'?” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, an óo an eemuuyene, akina amiikan ati kaamuuyen. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Amiikan ayeniyantoo ati miin fo cancowiyaaw, pale añii ya, ati toko fo cancowiyaaw. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ooto niŋ Añii ya ayihanaa aluu, efiniyih pánipani. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Inci méyimeyi nii aluu pakati miin ma miti Abraham. Pale hiŋes himukuyam inniyaake kaatuko taaluu hilimam hilehut ti saan aluu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Inci hisoku aluu eeha inci incuke ha ti Paapaa atoom iyyaake. Pale aluu eeha ínnisiye ha ti paapaa ataaluu inniyem ti íhinu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Nkañahanoo: “Paapaa atoonii ayem Abraham.” Yéesu naasokii: “Niŋ aluu epuuk Abraham anti níhin samat nii Abraham. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Inci, pánipani ya eyya inci ínsiye ya ti Pútuun pa iyyem aluu ti hisoku, pale aluu ínniyemi ti hiŋes himukuyam, Abraham kaloŋayoo, ataapala áhin eehuu. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Pale aluu, íhinu samat nii paapaa ataaluu inniyaake.” Nkañahanoo: “Unii upukutee ti pihaañiya, Paapaa oonool nuutaake akina ayem Pútuun pa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yéesu naasokii: “Niŋ Pútuun pa piyem Paapaa ataaluu, anti nílafiyam. Kaatuko inci pati Pútuun pa ínfulii, fiye íyyemi le. Inci kéyyoot ti faŋam pale pikina púpoñiyaam. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Weyme uwune hilim ha hitoom hicaaŋut aluu? Kaatuko niyinaat hicoonu eeha inci insok ha. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Paapaa ataaluu ayem áhampaatiin a ati <char style="w" lemma="Seetaani">piseetaani</char> pa, ínnilafi íhinu eeha níhisuum ha paapaa ataaluu. Akina amukala kápiliŋ ti púcook pa. Ataapala asiiŋo ti pánipani ya, kaatuko pánipani ya eneetaat teyoo. Niŋ acaamaa, pacukoo, kaatuko akina nincaama, náayemi paapaa ya ati kincaam ka. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Pale inci pánipani ya inci insok, ekina ewune níyinanutam. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ayme taaluu ayina káyisan nii inci muuyenaamuuyen? Niŋ pánipani ya inci insok, weyme uwune níyinanutam? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />An ati Pútuun, násiitansiitan eeha Pútuun pa mpusok ha, pale aluu nísiitanutam kamma innineetaat pakati Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ Abraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkasok Yéesu: “Fo pánipani tom nuusoke nii awe ati <char style="w">Samali</char>, <char style="w">hísaalumant</char> híwuuliyuu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Haani hísaalumant híwuuliitam, pale inci mákiyanaa-mákiyan paapaa atoom, aluu nímakiyanutam. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Inci tom láfiye pakan paka kati kámakiyanam. Taakaataak aŋa éelafiye pakan paka kati kámakiyanam, akina ayem áhina ya kíiti. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, niŋ an átuulaa hilim ha hitoom ataket.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Pusuwif pa nkasok Yéesu: “Fiye úmeyimeyi nii hísaalumant híwuuliyuu. <char style="w">Abraham</char> aketaaket, <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa lompo nkaket, pale awe insok nii, aŋa éetuule hilim ha hitii ataket. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Awe, fo aahaŋa Abraham paapaa atoonii? Akina aketaaket, piyaamakoola pa lompo nkaket. Fo weyme ancoke faŋi?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Niŋ inci mákiyanooliyaa, hamake ha hitoom hitaakut nafaa. Paapaa atoom ámakiyanaam, aŋa innisoke ya nii akina ayem Pútuun pa pitaaluu, <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />pale nímiitoo. Inci méyiyoomeyi; niŋ inci sokaa nii míitoo fayeno nincaama samat nii aluu. Pale méyiyoomeyi, íntuul hilim ha hiteyoo. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Abraham paapaa ataaluu, ti pásuuma naayeniye kaatuko ámeyimeyi nii afaacuk hinoom eeha inci inkaakaay ha écolii. Acukaacuk ho ínsuumoo.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Pusuwif pa nkasok Yéesu: “Aaloot taak fala sitiil áwii ésupak niŋ ŋaasuwan (50) insok nii aacukaacuk Abraham?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, Abraham ápukumee, Inci Yem.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:14">Efúlii 3:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ta nkásiye ta eehuu, nkayesal pukumpa kati <char style="w" lemma="Kaanunkal">kanunkaloo</char> pale Yéesu naayolo náaful ti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Káakuuñanee ka kiti áyiin éefuume kápiliŋ emma naapukee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yéesu ti pikaayu, naacuk áyiin éefuume emma naapukee. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Pinapana pa pakateyoo nkacakanoo: “Rabi, umuuyen wa uti ayme uwune áyiin a aŋe náafuum emma naapukee? Umuuyen wa uteyoo fo uti pupukayoo?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Neetaat umuuyen wa uteyoo neetaat lompo uti pupukayoo. Afúumaafuum ancuk páhin pa piti Pútuun pa kati píyisanee pínapii teyoo. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Hanakan ha uñaŋaa íhinu páhin pa piti éepoñiyaam ya, pale hánant ha uuha ti ékey ta an naayinantoo páhin. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Fa inci iyyem fa ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>, inci yem ecaaŋ ya eti púlunta pa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ta Yéesu naapaye ta káakup, naafaac ti esiya ya naanakanool yo niŋ mifaac ma, naanaaneen yo ti ñíkin éefuume ya. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Fiye naasokoo: “Kaay caañowo ti éwacuma eyya nkasok ya Silowam” (Silowam ekina eyem “eepoñee”). Eéfuume ya naakaañowo, ti éñohoonii ya eteyoo naacuk.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Pikinooloo niŋ payenka nkacukoo ka hínum ti kaaluumatool nkasok: “Fo neetaat káafuumafuum enka nkiyeno ka le kayen ti kaaluumatool?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Pakakee nkasok: “Akina.” Pakakee paka nkasok: “Haani akina tom, pale anakooloo.” Ayíin a naayeno hisoku: “Inci himuumam.” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Fiye nkacakanoo: “Ooto puume ñíkini íññipankiniye?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Naañahanii: “Ayíin a aŋa nkasok a Yéesu acoope esiya naapoocan yo naanaaneen yo ti ñíkinam, naasokam inci kaacaañowo Silowam. Fiye, inci inkaay picaañowo, íyyini hicuku.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Nkacakanoo: “Akina uwwey?” Naañahanii: “Inci míit.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pufalisaay pa kaacakanool ka kiteyii éefuume ya hínum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Púful toko, nkacoop éefuume ya hínum pati <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Inhemool hinoom eeha Yéesu naapoocane ha esiya ya náakuuñan éefuume ya, hikina hiyem <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> hiti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Fiye Pufalisaay pa lompo nkayeno kaacakanool áyiin a puume ñíkinoo íññipankiniye. Ayíin a naasokii: “Esiya naapoocane niŋ mifaac naanaaneen yo ti ñíkinam, inkaañowo, incuk.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Pakakee ti Pufalisaay pa nkasok: “Ayíin a aŋe áfuliyoot pati Pútuun pa, kaatuko átuulut hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka.” Pale pakakee paka nkasok: “Puume amuuyena áfinnayini íhinu píyisan empuu?” Fiye nkápaacinoolo. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Púful toko, nene kacakan éefuume ya hínum: “Awe, weyme ayyina hisoku kiteyoo? Páawoo ñíkini náapankine.” Naañahanii: “<char style="w">Ayaamakoola</char>.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Pale pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa nkapook káyinan nii áyiin a éefuume hínum, apan fiye oopa ti hicuku. Káyinanut fo ta nkáyonkalii ta pupukayoo. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Ta pupukayoo nkácolii ta, ñíhampaatiin ña pakati Pusuwif pa nkacakanii: “Fo aŋe añiin aluu, aŋa innisoke ya nii éefuume kápiliŋ emma naapukee? Puume náahine apucuk?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Pupukayoo nkañahanii: “Uméyimeyi nii aŋe añiin unii, éefuume ya kápiliŋ ta naapukee. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Pale unii úmiit puume náahine fo ácukii, éepankine ya ñíkinoo lompo úmiitoo. Pale añii tom; nicakanoo, afaañahan aluu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />(Pupukayoo kákupaakup fiyuu kamma nkafeye pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa. Kaatuko kásiyoolaa-síyool nii efikakit ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya an óo an eesoke nii Yéesu ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ekina ewune pupukayoo nkasok: “Nicakanoo, añii tom.”)<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Fiye Pufalisaay pa nkáyonkalii áyiin a éefuume ya hínum púsupiyenu, nkasokoo: “Aapa hátikin Pútuun pa, sok pánipani ya! Unii úmeyimeyi nii an a aŋuu amuuyena.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Naañahanii: “Inci míit man amuuyena pale hoonool inci immeya, inci hínum éefuume pale fiye inci oopa ti hicuku.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Nkacakanoo: “Weyme náahinuu? Puume náahine ápipankin ñíkini?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Ayíin a naañahanii: “Inci payaapa ho aluu hisoku, pale nísiitanutam. Weyme uwune ínnilafi pinene sok ho aluu? Fo aluu lompo nílafilafi piyeno pinapana pa pakateyoo?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Fiye nkayeniyoo kateñal ti hisokuyoo: “Awe yem anapana ya ati áyiin a aŋuu, unii pinapana pakati <char style="w">Móyiis</char>. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Uméyimeyi nii Pútuun pa niŋ Móyiis mpúkupe, pale áyiin aŋuu úmiit fala peyme náafulii.” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Ayíin a naañahanii: “Eehuu hínimaam, nímiit peyme náafulii apan náapankin ñíkinam! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Uméyiyaameyi nii Pútuun pa písiitanantoo pumuuyena pa pale mpísiitan-síitan eefeye po náahin eeha mpílafiye ha. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kápiliŋ emma <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> mpíyaañe ma, hitaapala hísiyee nii, an ápankine ñíkin éefuume emma naapukee. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Niŋ áyiin a aŋuu áfuliyoot pati Pútuun pa, átayini íhinu waah.” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Nkañahanoo: “Awe, eloŋi púlooŋ ti kaamuuyen neeyem emma ampukee, fiye állafi unii kakalaŋan?” Ti oom káasiiŋuma nkayaanoo tíkitaaŋ.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hífuumu kunuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yéesu náasi nii éefuume ya hínum, <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa kayaanooyaan. Fiye, Yéesu naakaayoo hiŋes, naacukoo naasokoo: “Fo áayinanaayinan ti <char style="w">Añii An</char>?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Ayíin a naañahanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, sokam akina ayem ayme, ancuk inci yínanaa teyoo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Aacukoocuk, akina ayem fiye ti káakup niŋ awe.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Ayíin a naañahanoo: “<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>, inci yínanaa.” Náakilipo hátikinoo puhooŋuyoo t’etaam. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Púful toko, Yéesu naasokoo: “Kíiti ewune inci ínkey ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>: ancuk kéefuume ka kati kacuk, keecuke ka nkáfuum.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Pakakee ti Pufalisaay pa keeyeniye ka toko nkási eeha Yéesu naayeniye ha hisoku, nkacakanoo: “Fo unii lompo úfuumaafuum?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Niŋ nífuumaafuum anti níyeniyaati pumuuyena pale páawoo nisokaasok nii nicukaacuk, kaamuuyen ka kitaaluu etikiponketee.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Afaasa ya niŋ koolee ya eteyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yéesu naasokii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, an óo an eenaput ti hunkut ha hiti híkinku ha hiti písaacii pa pale naasilo ti híkinku ha, oom an álipa, akanca. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Pale eenape ya ti hunkut ha ayem afaasa ya ati písaacii pa. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Awásuma híkinku ha áfaapankinoo hunkut ha, písaacii pa mpísi hilimoo; sáacii óo sáacii eteyoo, afaayonkal yo ti caacaw eteyyo mpinapanoo tíkitaaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Niŋ áfulaniyoo písaacii pa piteyoo púlooŋ, naanow po hátikin, pikina mpinapanoo kamma mpikiiwe hilimoo. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Etipinapan <char style="w">akaawoola</char>, pale efipiteyoo kamma mpikiiwut hilim ekaawoola ya.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yéesu naakamanii hícantiitu eehuu, pale kámiit eeha náalafiyii ha hisoku.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu afaasa ya eenape ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Fiye Yéesu nene asok: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, inci yem hunkut ha hiti písaacii pa. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Kéekeyii ka púlooŋ le niŋ inci fácolii, pílipa niŋ pikanca. Pale písaacii pa písiitanutii. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Inci yem hunkut ha. An óo an eenape ti inci afaafakanee. Afánayini énakoonii niŋ hífulu nataak paliyal. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Alípa ya nákeykey káalipu, himuku niŋ káapucalool lamma. Pale inci kéyyookey pakan paka kati kataak eloŋ, nkaloŋ yo pánipani.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Inci yem afaasa ya eenape ya. Afaasa ya eenape ya nacooncoon kawufan eloŋoo kamma písaacii pa piteyoo. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Pikee pa áhampaatiin a ati písaacii pa naacoop an apiyeno afaasa ati písaacii pa piteyoo. Oom an efaas naayaake kamma naakaakaayee cooy; niŋ acukaa eyen elampa ti ékey afaatah toko písaacii pa naatey, kaatuko piteyoo tom. Fiye eyen elampa ya neelaako po neehancalool po. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Ayíin a ateyaatey kamma naacoopee páhin, cokutoo ti písaacii pa. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15" />Inci yem afaasa ya eenape ya. Paapaa ya náameyiyam inci lompo ímmeyi Paapaa ya, fo lompo incuke inci méyimeyi písaacii pa putoom, písaacii pa putoom lompo mpímeyiyam. Inci incooncoon kawufan eloŋ ya etoom kamma písaacii pa. <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Inci taakaataak pikee písaacii peeneetaat ti híkinku eehe, empuu lompo ñaŋaa po écoopii, éfipisiitan hilimam. Ancuk koolee yoonool etaakiyaa niŋ afaasa oonool. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Paapaa ya álafiyaamlafi kamma inci incoon kawufan eloŋ ya etoom kati sa yo nene. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />An ayinaat hicoopu eloŋ ya etoom pale inci uwwufan yo ti pásuumayam. Inci taakaataak kayine kiti kawufan eteyyo niŋ kayine kiti hisayu eteyyo nene, eehe Paapaa atoom naasokaam kati hín.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Kilim enkuu nene kípaacinool <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Hícump teyii nkasok: “<char style="w">Hísaalumant</char> híwuuliyoo! Awuyaawuyo! Weyme ínnisiitanoo?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Pale pakakee paka nkasok: “An aŋa hísaalumant níhiwuuliye ákupantoo fiye. Fo hísaalumant éfihiyini káapankin ñíkin éefuume?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pusuwif pa káayinanaati ka kiteyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Máamun sitiil keme niŋ áwii éhaaciil (160) le niŋ Yéesu afaapukee, pikamool <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkanako ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa kapilecatan yo. Fiyuu Pusuwif pa nkayinaat kaawaaseen Pútuun pa. Hikee hinoom, akee áyiin aŋa nkasok Yutas Makape naaheek pikamoolii naakuulan ekumpaan ya enfakat ya. Pahaaño pa piti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya, eehuu mpínawunan.</char></note> eeyem ya <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> mpúcolii, tempo ti caanak citi pamon. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yéesu naayeno kaamuumuusool ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya, la nkasok la címpaŋ ya eti <char style="w">Solomon</char>. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Fiye, pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkákiitooloo nkasokoo: “Fo teyme aafakat unii ti énimaan? Iyyema awe yem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa caaŋan unii.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Sokaasok ho aluu pale níyinanut. Píyisan empa inci ínhin pa ti caacaw Paapaa atoom, pikina píyisane aŋa inci iyyem ya. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Pale aluu níyinanut, kaatuko nineetaat ti písaacii pa putoom. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Pinapana pa pakatoom kacukaacuk nii písaacii empa mpísiitan hilimam. Inci méyiyiimeyi nkanapanam. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Uwwufanii eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya. Inci étipuulii, an lompo átayiniyii hilamu ti epeesam. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Paapaa atoom eewufanaamii ya ahaŋa an óo an, an ayinaatii hilamu ti epees Paapaa atoom. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Inci niŋ Paapaa ya an oonool.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Pusuwif pa nene kayesal pukumpa kati <char style="w" lemma="Kaanunkal">kanunkal</char> Yéesu fo aket. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Pale Yéesu naasokii: “Hícump páhin peenape inci íyyisane aluu púpufulii pati Paapaa ya, empeyme tempo puwune ínnilafiyam kaanunkal pukumpa fo ket?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Pusuwif pa nkañahanoo: “Neetaat páhin peenape puwune núulafiyi himuku, pale fa anteñale fa Pútuun pa, awe an kenseŋ insok nii awe Pútuun!” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yéesu naasokii: “Fo kiicutee ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hitaaluu nii Pútuun pa pusok: <char style="qt">'Inci sok, aluu ñútuun'?</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Kícimu 82:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Uméyiyaameyi nii <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> hiyinaatee hípucu. Ooto niŋ piyonkalaa payenka mpúkupe ka neyii 'ñútuun', <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />weyme uwune innisok nii inci teñalaateñal Pútuun pa kamma inci insoke nii inci yem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa? Apan inci yem aŋa Paapaa ya naamamale ya náapoñiyam ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>. <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Niŋ inci hínut páhin pa piti Paapaa atoom, timpi níyinanam, <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />pale niŋ inci hínaa po, háati níyinanutam, níyinan eeha inci ínhin ha kati nímeyi innikiiw nii Paapaa ya oopa ti inci, inci lompo oopa ti Paapaa ya.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Fiye, nene kayeno hiŋes hicokuyoo pale naafakii.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Púful toko, Yéesu naañoho apifiitan musuu ma miti Jordan la <char style="w">Saŋ</char> náacooke la íhinu <char style="w">pátise</char>, naayeno toko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Hícump pakan nkákey teyoo. Nkasokool: “Saŋ, háati áhinut píyisan poonool pale waah ewwa naasoke wa púlooŋ kiti áyiin a aŋe, uti pánipani.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Hícump pakan toko, nkáyinan ti Yéesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Eket ya eti Lasaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Intaako áyiin éekuuñe caacawoo Lasaar. Naakin ti saatee ya eti Betani niŋ pakahoopoo <char style="w">Mari</char> niŋ Maarta. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mari aŋe ayem aŋa eenuce ya <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> niŋ munucu méesuume haaw naatoot wootoo niŋ wanoo. Ahoopoo ayem Lasaar éekuuñe ya. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Pakahoopoo nkapoñ an pati Yéesu apicaasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, áwiyi aŋa állafiye ya ákuuñaakuuñ.” <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Ta Yéesu náasiye ta eehuu naasok: “Káakuuñu enkuu kiti himukuyoo tom, pale éfikiyisan hamake ha hiti Pútuun pa. Pínapii tenko Añii ya ati Pútuun pa áfaamakiyanee.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yéesu náalafi Maarta niŋ atuwoo niŋ Lasaar meemak. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ta náasiye ta nii Lasaar ákuuñaakuuñ, naayeno pa naayeniye pa fo kunoom kúsupak.<verse eid="JHN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Púful toko naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Uñohiyaa ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char>.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Pinapana pa nkañahanoo: “Rabi, fiyiit ta <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkálafiyuu <char style="w">kaanunkal</char> niŋ pukumpa fo aaket, fiye awe ínneelafi upuñohiyaa po?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Fo siwaati ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak tom siyem ti hanakan? Niŋ an asapalaa niŋ hanakan átafukoolo kaatuko acukaacuk ecaaŋ ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Púlunta pa">púlunta</char> empe. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Pale niŋ ayeniyaa pikaayu niŋ hánant áfaafukoolo kaatuko ataakut ecaaŋ.”<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ta naapaye ta káakup, nene asokii: “Awí unaa Lasaar aŋotaaŋot, pale inci pikaayu káyiyaloo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Pinapana pa pakateyoo nkañahanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, niŋ hiŋotu naayaake ooto afaafisak.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yéesu hisokuyii naayeniye nii Lasaar aketaaket pale pinapana pa pakateyoo incukii nii hiŋotu kenseŋ naasokii. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Fiye Yéesu naasokii picaaŋ nii: “Lasaar aketaaket. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Súumaamsuum fa eehuu nihitookutam fa po, ancuk níyinanaa, pale ukaayaa pateyoo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Fiye Tomas, aŋa nkasok a lompo Máasupak ma, naasok pákawiyoo pinapana pa: “Unaa lompo ukaayaa ancuk nuuketaa neyoo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu eeyem ya pilito pa niŋ eloŋ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ta Yéesu naacole ta, naatook loho Lasaar ahokee fo ataak kunoom kipaakiil. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Po Betani, láaŋoolut niŋ <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, máamun sikilomeetal síhaaciil. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Ekina ewune hícump <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> nkakaay pati Maarta niŋ <char style="w">Mari</char> piŋaapo keeŋoot ka kiti ahoopii. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ta Maarta náasiye ta nii Yéesu oopa ti ékey, naakaay kaapaakoolanoo, Mari naayeno t’enuuf. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Maarta naasok Yéesu: “Ahámpaatiin, niŋ le ayyeniye, ahoopam anti áketaati. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Pale fo fiye inci méyimeyi nii waah óo waah ewwa alluume Pútuun pa, efipuwuni wo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Ahoopi afaalito ti eket ya.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Maarta naañahanoo: “Inci méyimeyi nii áfaalitoonii ti eket ya ti hinoom ha hikelan ha hiti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Inci yem pilito pa, inci lompo yem eloŋ ya. An óo an éeyinane ti inci, háati naaket afaaloŋ. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />An óo an eeloŋe náayinan ti inci ataket háati poonool. Fo áayinanaayinan eehe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Maarta naañahanoo: “Ee Ahámpaatiin, inci yínanaayinan nii awe yem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char>, Añii ya ati Pútuun pa eeñaŋe ya ékey ti púlunta pa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Púful toko Maarta naacaayonkal atuwoo Mari naapuusanooloo apusokoo: “Ahámpaatiin a ácoliyoo, oopa nacakani.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ta Mari náasiye ta eehuu, naalito naahiliikan apikaay pateyoo. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Tempo Yéesu aloot anako ti saatee ya, la Maarta naapaakoolanoo la naaloŋe. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Pusuwif pa keeyeniye ka niŋ Mari nkayeniyoo kaapuuñanool, nkacukoo naalitiye mpacas náaful, nkanapanoo pucukii nii pikaayu pukooŋ pati hiyaak ha naayaake.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Ta Mari naacole ta la Yéesu naayeniye la, apucukoo naanow ti wootoo naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, niŋ le ayyeniye ahoopam anti áketaati.” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Ta Yéesu naacuke ta Mari ti pukooŋ niŋ Pusuwif pa kéenapaniyoo ka lompo ti pukooŋ, yaanoo neemeeŋ niŋ kúnuul inseeñoo. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Naasokii: “Peyme innihokoo?” Nkañahanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, kéy aapucuk.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yéesu naakooŋ. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Fiye Pusuwif pa nkasokool: “Nisincan fa náalafiyoo fa!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Pale pakakee paka nkasok: “Fo akina éepankine ya ñíkin áyiin a éefuume ya, ayinaat fala káakuuñan Lasaar áketum?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elítaniyee ya eti Lasaar ti eket ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yéesu nene ameeŋ niŋ kúnuul, naakaay ti hiyaak ha. Hiyaak ha níhiyemi ti kaayeen kenfakat. Enánkiin enfakat epanke putum pa piti hiyaak ha. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yéesu naasok: “Nífulan énankiin ya.” Maarta, ahoop a ati eekete ya, naañahanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, fiye afutaa kaatuko taakaa kunoom kipaakiil.” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Pale Yéesu naasokoo: “Fo inci sokuti nii, náayinanaa aafacuk hamake ha hiti Pútuun pa?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Fiye, nkáfulan énankiin ya. Yéesu náahaafin naasok: “Paapaa, inci sokuu apalaka fa ánsiyaam fa. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Inci méyimeyi nii ánsiyamsi tan óo tan, pale kayoŋ enke kuwune inci ínkup, kati kíyinan nii awe póñiyaam.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ta Yéesu naapaye ta káakup, naaceek niŋ kaawiiluyoo: “Lasaar, fúlii!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Ayíin a eekete ya náafulii, sipeesoo niŋ wootoo insipoonanoolee niŋ wañ uti ehok, puhooŋuyoo mpukuupatanoolee niŋ cifaal. Yéesu naasok: “Nícenkinoo innikatanoo apikaay.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hikuucuyee ha hiti himuku ha hiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Hícump ti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa kéekeyii ka hiyoop <char style="w">Mari</char> nkacuk eeha Yéesu náahine ha nkáyinan teyoo. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Pale pakakee teyii nkakaay pati <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkakamanii eeha Yéesu náahine ha. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Fiye, Pufalisaay pa niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> nkaconcoolan ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya pakati Pusuwif pa, nkasok: “Weyme nuukaakaayaa íhinu? Ayíin a aŋe oopa ti íhinu hícump píyisan. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Niŋ ukatanoo aputowo fiye ti pikaayu, pakan paka púlooŋ éfikayinan teyoo. Pakati <char style="w">Room</char> éfikasi ho nkákey kapihancalool <char style="w" lemma="Ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya</char> etuunaa eti Pútuun pa niŋ síi ya etuunaa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “kapihancalool letuunaa niŋ síi ya etuunaa.” </char></note><verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Akee teyii caacawoo Kayif, akina ayeniye awaaseena ya enfakat a oom etiil, naasokii: “Aluu nímiit likee! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Nípannumut nii haŋa panap taaluu an oonool apiket kamma pakan paka, le niŋ síi ya púlooŋ éfeepucaloolee.” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Kayif asokut eehuu ti faŋoo, pale fa naayeniye fa awaaseena ya enfakat a ti oom etiil, ekina ewune naayaamakool nii Yéesu añaŋaa eket kamma síi ya eti Pusuwif pa. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Apan ataket kamma síi eyyuu lamma pale kati aconcenool epuuk Pútuun pa púlooŋ keehancalooliye ka kapiyeno hímaaf hoonool.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Fiye písik oom hinoom, pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa nkasiiŋiye kati kamuk Yéesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ekina ewune Yéesu náayekuno kaakaawool ápiyisanoolo ti Pusuwif pa, pale naakaay ti saatee eekole <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>, nkasok yo Efreem, naayeno toko niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ti oom caanak, pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char> hiti Pusuwif pa mpúlohanii, hícump pakan nkáfulii ti pisaatee pa niŋ misaatee ma kapisilo <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> kati kakuulanoolo le niŋ pahaaño pa. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Nkayeno hiŋes Yéesu loho kasiiŋiyaa lati ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa nkayeno picakanool: “Weyme ínnimiiloole? Fo áfaalah ápikey pahaaño pa?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa niŋ Pufalisaay pa kawufanaawufan hilim nii, an óo an eemeya pa Yéesu naayem, añaŋaa kakaman ancuk kati acokee.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Hinucuyee ha hiti Yéesu Betani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Ta intowiye ta kunoom isak niŋ hoonool pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char> hiti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa kati píhinee, Yéesu naacol Betani la Lasaar aŋa naalitane ya ti eket ya naakine la. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Po Betani, nkamemanool káciim kápimakiyan Yéesu. Maarta naayeno ti keeyeniye ka kawasu oom káciim, Lasaar naayeno ti keeyeniye ka niŋ Yéesu ti taapul ya. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" /><char style="w">Mari</char> naacoop máamun kancaŋ kilo eti munucu méesuume haaw méeciita hinoom meememanoolee niŋ naat eti pánipani, naanuc woot Yéesu naatoot wo niŋ wanoo, ekumpaan ya púlooŋ neehaaŋo púsuum. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Fiye Judas Iskaliyot, akee ti pinapana pa (aŋa eekaakaay ya hífulu ti Yéesu) naasok: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Weyme uwune munucu ma munoomanutee ti soŋ eti cooy áhina etiil púmpuluŋ, mañ ma ummuwufanee keeleke ka?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Asokaasok eehuu kaatuko álipa, ámiiloolut keeleke ka. Akina namank mañ ma miteyii, temmo nálip.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Katanoo! Amankaamank munucu emme hak hinoom ha hiti ehok ya etoom. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Keeleke ka efikayeno niŋ aluu tan óo tan, pale inci etinitaakam tan óo tan.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Máciya 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mark 14:3-9</ref> </char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piteŋenool pa piti himukuyee ha Lasaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Hícump ti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkakaay Betani ta nkásiye ta nii Yéesu oopa po, Yéesu lamma awunut nkakaay pale Lasaar aŋa naalitane ya ti eket ya nkálafiye hicuku lompo. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Ekina ewune <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> nkasiiŋo kati kamuk lompo Lasaar. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Kaatuko akina awune hícump Pusuwif nkakatanii nkáyinan ti Yéesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu, pinako pa piteyoo Jerusalem samat nii amansa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Eti kacom eteyyo, kayoŋ ka kenfakat ka kéekeyii ka ti pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char> nkísi nii Yéesu oopa ti ékey <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Nkáyekanalii ékunt incakapaakoolanoo tíkitaaŋ saatee ya ti hílulu, nkayeno hiceeku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Hosanna!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naasokaa “hosanna” ekina eyem “úmulaa Pútuun pa”.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">
    <char style="qt">Alímaati <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa pisampan éekeyii ya ti caacaw etempo,</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Kícimu 118:25-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">amansa ya ati <char style="w">Israyel</char>.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yéesu naacuk cífali naalapo tenco samat nii fa inkiicee fa ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />
    <char style="qt">“Timpi nife, aluu pakati <char style="w">Siyon</char>;</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">
    <char style="qt">nisincan, amansa ya ataaluu oopa ti ékey,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">
    <char style="qt">oopa álapoonii ti cífali.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Sakaliya 9:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="JHN 12:15" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Ti oom caanak, pinapana pa pakati Yéesu kámiit heeyeniye ha pitaako, pale po hátikin ta hamake ha hiti Yéesu níhiyisanee ta nkápannum nii eehuu hikiicee kiteyoo, apan hikina lompo nkáhinoo. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Tempo kayoŋ ka keetantake ka ta Yéesu naayonkale ta Lasaar ápufulii ti hiyaak ha, náalitaniyoo ti eket ya, nkutowo ti káatuunan heetaakiye ha. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ekina ewune, kayoŋ ka nkikaay kapaakoolan Yéesu kamma nkísiye nii áhinaahin píyisan empuu. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Fiye, <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkasokool: “Nisincan, niyinaat toko waah, pakan paka púlooŋ unka ti kanapanoo!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pálafi pa piti pakakee keeneetaat Pusuwif hicuku Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Intaak pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Keeneetaat ka Pusuwif">keeneetaat Pusuwif</char> ti keesiliye ka <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> kaluum Pútuun pa ti pahaaño pa. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Nkákey ti <char style="w">Filip</char> ati Petesayit eti <char style="w">Galilee</char> nkasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, úlafilafi hicuku Yéesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filip naacaasok ho Andre, poko t’ésupakii incakasok ho Yéesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Caanak ca cícoliyoocol, ancuk hamake ha hiti inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, kati híyisanee. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, taamanta kaalat kunowut t’etaam nkiket, efikutowo lamma etenko, pale niŋ kiketaa efikupukool meemak. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />An óo an éelafiye eloŋ ya eteyoo áfaapuul teyyo, pale an óo an eenate eloŋ ya eteyoo ti <char style="w" lemma="Púlunta pa">púlunta</char> púlooŋ empe afaataak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />An óo an éelafiye piyeno áhina ya atoom, ánapaniyam, apan la inci fayeno la, áhina ya atoom lompo afaayeno toko. An óo an eeyem áhina ya atoom, Paapaa atoom áfaamakiyanoo.”<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu káakup ka kiteyoo kiti eket ya eteyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Yéesu nene asokii: “Fiye yaanam yoopiya emeeŋe niŋ kúnuul. Weyme inci fasok? Fo inci fasok: 'Paapaa fakanam ti caanak ca citi kúnuul enke'? Haani, kaatuko caanak ence fanfaŋ ciwune inci ínkey ti <char style="w" lemma="Púlunta pa">púlunta</char> empe. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Paapaa, yísan hamake ha hiti caacawi!” Fiye, hilim níhifulii patiila nihisok: “Inci yísanaa ho ántuŋ efinene yísan ho.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Kayoŋ ka keeyeniye ka toko nkísi eehuu, nkusok: “Aŋuu pasapal etiil” pale, pakakee teyii nkasok: “<char style="w">Maleekoo</char> ékupe neyoo.”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yéesu naasokii: “Inci tom wune hilim eehuu níhikupee pale aluu niwune. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Fiye kíiti ya eti púlunta empe écoliyoo; fiye ati hikaw ha ati púlunta empe afaaheekee. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Pale niŋ inci séepinee, fáñakii ti faŋam pakan paka púlooŋ.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Asokaasok kilim enkuu ápiyisan puume naakaakaay eket.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Kayoŋ ka nkiñahanoo: “Ukalaŋaakalaŋ ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> nii <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa afaatowo fo cancowiyaaw. Fiye awe, puume ayyina hisoku nii <char style="w">Añii An</char> áfaaseepinee? Ayme ayem Añii An aŋuu?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Ecaaŋ ya uyya niŋ aluu pale etefiyo. Nitowo ti pikaayu fa innitaake fa ecaaŋ ya, ancuk énimaan ya étenowii ti aluu. Kaatuko eeyem ya ti pikaayu ti énimaan ámeyiyantoo pa naayem ti pikaayu. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Páawoo unka nitaake ecaaŋ ya, níyinan ti ecaaŋ ya kati níyenoonii epuuk ya pakati ecaaŋ ya.” Ta Yéesu naapaye ta káakup naañako apiyoliyii.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káayinanaati ka kiti Pusuwif pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Háati fa Yéesu náahine fa píyisan peemeeŋe hátikinii, káyinanut teyoo. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Fiyuu hilim ha eeha <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w">Esayi</char> naakiice ha nihitaakiye, hisok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">
    <char style="qt">“<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>, ayme áyinane ekooŋan ya etoonii?</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">
    <char style="qt">Ti ayme Ateeteyo náayisane sempe sa siti sipeesoo?”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:1">Esayi 53:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="JHN 12:38" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Kayinaat káyinan. Esayi nene akiic kati akaman unaa heewune ha. Asok:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />
    <char style="qt">“Pútuun pa púfuumanii</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">mpiyankan saanii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">ancuk timpi kacuk niŋ ñíkinii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">timpi kámeyi niŋ kunuuwii, étikayesoonii lipe ti inci Pútuun pa</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">inci kati kúuñanii.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:10">Esayi 6:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="JHN 12:40" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Esayi asokaasok eehuu kamma naacuke hamake ha hiti Yéesu náakup kiteyoo. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Antúŋ hícump pakan, háati ti pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, nkáyinan ti Yéesu pale <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa kawune káhaañiit ho káyisan ti kafeyatan kapiyaanee ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Kaatuko kafisakanoolaa-fisakanool pakan paka kati kámakiyanii pihaŋ fa Pútuun pa éfipimakiyanii fa.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yéesu naaceek niŋ kaawiiluyoo naasok: “An óo an éeyinane ti inci, áyinanut ti inci pale ti éepoñiyaam ya náayinane. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Apan an óo an eecukaam acukaacuk lompo éepoñiyaam ya. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Inci kéyyookey ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> samat nii ecaaŋ, ancuk an óo an éeyinane ti inci atatowo ti énimaan ya. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />An óo an éesiye hilimam átuulut ho, inci tom fáhinoo kíiti insiiŋanoo ti pisiya, kaatuko inci kéyyoot ti púlunta pa kati hín pakan paka kíiti insiiŋanii ti pisiya; inci, kafakan pakan paka kuwune inci ínkey. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Pale an óo an eepookaam naapook kasayan hilimam ataakaataak áhina kíiti: hilim eeha inci insoke ha éfihihinoo kíiti ti hinoom ha hikelan ha hiti púlunta pa. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Kaatuko inci kúput héefulii ti inci, pale Paapaa ya éepoñiyaam ya asokaam eeha inci iññaŋe ha hisoku niŋ fa inci iññaŋe ho fa hisoku. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Inci méyimeyi nii hilim ha hiteyoo heesiiŋanee ha nihiwufan eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya. Eeha inci insok ha, insoksok ho samat nii fa Paapaa atoom naasokaam fa.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Hiñowu ha hiti Yéesu woot pinapana pa pakateyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Le niŋ pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char>, Yéesu náameyi nii caanak ca cícoliyoocol kati akatan <char style="w" lemma="Púlunta pa">púlunta</char> empe naakaay pati Paapaa ya. Kápiliŋ ti púcook pa náalafiye pakateyoo keeyem ka ti púlunta pa, náalafiyii lompo fo ti pikelan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “náalafiyii lompo fo muus.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo nkayeno hili káciim, tempo loho áhampaatiin a ati <char style="w" lemma="Seetaani">piseetaani</char> pa apayaa híluuŋu Judas Iskaliyot, añii ya ati Simon, kati áful ti Yéesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yéesu náameyi nii Paapaa ya awufanoowufan sempe sa púlooŋ, náameyi lompo nii akina pati Pútuun pa náafulii ántuŋ pati Pútuun pa naayem ti puñoho. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Fiye naalito ti hili ha, naawaat hísool ha hiteyoo henfakat ha, naacoop kaafaal naacenk ko ti hiñowuyoo. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Eehuu hipipa, naawas man ti epool, náayaañ hiñowu woot pinapana pa pakateyoo, naatoot wo niŋ kaafaal enka naacenke ka ti hiñowuyoo.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Apucol ti Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char>, Simon Piyeer naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, fo awe kaakaay hiñowu wootam?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Fiye fiye, awe míit eeha inci iyyem ha ti íhinu pale hátikin áafapannum.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Piyeer naasokoo: “Haani, hiyinaat pitaako! Aatiñow wootam.” Yéesu naañahanoo: “Taamanta inci ñowut wooti áatiyini hitaaku himpaac ti inci.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simon Piyeer naasokoo: “Ooto Ahámpaatiin, timpi ñow wootam lamma pale sipeesam niŋ hikawam lompo!” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “An eeñowiye, wootoo lamma naañaŋe hiñowu, akina an eekuule naat. Antúŋ aluu nikuulaakuul, pale neetaat an óo an taaluu.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Kaatuko ámeyimeyi eekaakaay ya hífulu teyoo, tempo wune naasok: “Neetaat an óo an taaluu akuule.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ta naapaye ta hiñowu wootii, naawaso hísool ha hiteyoo henfakat ha, naañoho ti káayenuma ka kiteyoo. Naacakanii: “Fo nímeyimeyi eeha inci impaye ha aluu íhinu? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Inniyonkalam-yonkal 'Akalaŋana' niŋ 'Ahámpaatiin', ántuŋ fo, kaatuko akina inci iyyem. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Fiye páawoo inci, Akalaŋana ya niŋ Ahámpaatiin a ataaluu, ñowaa woot aluu, aluu lompo niñaŋaa puñowool woot aluu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Inci yísanaayisan aluu fa éfinihin. Níhin samat nii fa inci ínhine fa aluu. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, amiikan ahaŋut áhampaatiin a ateyoo, eepoñee lompo ahaŋut eepoñoo ya. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Páawoo nimeya fiye enke, efiniyeno ti pásuuma niŋ níhinaa ko.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Neetaat ti káakup kitaaluu púlooŋ, inci méyimeyi payenka inci immamale ka. Pale heekiicee ha ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>, fo hitaako, hisok: <char style="qt">'Aŋa inci mpáacinoole ya neyoo hímpuul ha hitoom, áyesoonii ti inci.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Kícimu 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Inci oopa ti hisoku aluu eehuu fiye le niŋ efihitaako, ancuk niŋ hitaakiyaa ínniyinan nii Inci Yem aŋa inci iyyem ya. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, an óo an eesayane aŋa inci impoñe, inci naasayane; an óo an eesayanaam, asayanaasayan éepoñiyaam ya.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaman ka kiti Yéesu eket ya eteyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yéesu ta naapaye ta káakup enke, yaanoo neemeeŋ niŋ kúnuul náakupii picaaŋ cataŋ: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, akee ti aluu áfaaful ti inci.” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Pinapana pa nkásincanool, ínnimii niŋ ayme naayem. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Akee teyii, anapana ya aŋa Yéesu náalafiye ya, naayeno pukoloo ti taapul ya. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char> náakupoo niŋ pasiŋ: “Cakanoo niŋ ayme naayem.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Fiye, anapana ya aŋuu naayaaco ti Yéesu, naacakanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, niŋ ayme ayyem?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Akina ayem aŋa inci inkaakaay ya kawufan cífiitiin hímpuul eehe niŋ inci púucaa co ti mutop ma.” Fiye, náapuuc cífiitiin hímpuul ha, naawufan co Judas, añii ya ati Simon Iskaliyot. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Emma Judas naasaye ma cífiitiin hímpuul ha, áhampaatiin a ati <char style="w" lemma="Seetaani">piseetaani</char> pa néewuuliyoo. Yéesu naasokoo: “Eeha ayyem ha ti ékey íhinu, hín ho mpacas.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Pale háati an ti keeyeniye ka ti taapul ya ámiit heewune Yéesu naasokoo fo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Páawoo Judas ayem amanka ya mañ ma, pakakee pinapana pa incukii nii Yéesu hisokuyoo naayaake akaay hinoom aŋa nkasoolahe ya hak pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char>, niŋ ekina tom awun waah keeleke ka. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Emma Judas naasaye ma cífiitiin hímpuul ha, náaful tíkitaaŋ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:30">Tempo hánant.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hilim heesiiŋanee héeyeeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ta Judas naakaaye ta, Yéesu naasok: “Fiye hamake ha hiti inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, éfihiyisanee, hamake ha hiti Pútuun pa éfihiyisanee lompo pínapii ti inci. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Niŋ hamake ha hiti Pútuun pa híyisanee pínapii ti inci, ooto Pútuun pa faŋ etempo éfipiyisan lompo hamake ha hiti inci, Añii An, ántuŋ éfipiyisan ho toko fiye. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Epuukam, inci etifiyo niŋ aluu. Efiniŋesam, pale samat nii fa inci insoke fa <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, insok ho fiye aluu: 'Pa inci iyyem pa ti pikaayu, étiniyini po ékey.' <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Fiye inci oopa ti kawufan aluu hilim heesiiŋanee héeyeeni: nílafooli, samat nii fa inci íllafiye fa aluu, fo inniñaŋe pálafooli. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Niŋ nílafooliyaa, pakan paka púlooŋ éfikameyi nii aluu pinapana pa pakatoom.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naacakanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, peyme ayyem ti pikaayu?” Yéesu naañahanoo: “Pa inci iyyem pa ti pikaayu, aayinaatam kanapan toko fiye, pale hátikin áafanapaniyam po.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Piyeer naacakanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, weyme uwune inci étiyini kanapani fiye? Inci fawufan eloŋam kamma awe.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Fo pánipani aafawufan eloŋi kamma inci? Inci pusoki pánipani ya, káayiin ekutoon kúlookum áafalaacin fo ñáhaaciil nii áameyiyam-méyi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yéesu, pítin pa peekaakaay pa pati Paapaa ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yéesu nene asok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Timpi niliim, níyinan ti Pútuun pa ínniyinan ti inci lompo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “níyinanaayinan ti Pútuun pa, níyinan lompo ti inci.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Ti ekumpaan ya eti Paapaa atoom, taakaataak píkaap peemeeŋe; niŋ neetaat fo, inci etisok aluu nii inci picaamemanool aluu la efinikin. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Niŋ inci kaayaa kaamemanool aluu la efinikin, fáñohoonii pucoop aluu nipiyeno niŋ inci, ancuk la inci iyyem la, aluu lompo inniyeno toko. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Pa inci inkaakaay pa, nímeyimeyi pítin pa.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomas naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, unii úmiit peyme ankaakaay, ooto puume éfuuyini kameye pítin pa?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yéesu naasokii: “Inci yem pítin pa, inci lompo yem pánipani ya niŋ eloŋ ya. An átayini pikaayu pati Paapaa ya taamanta anaput ti inci. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Niŋ nimeyaam éfinimeyi lompo Paapaa ya. Písik fíyooy nímeyiyoomeyi innicukoo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Niŋ nímeyiyaam-méyi pánipani, anti nímeyi lompo Paapaa ya. Pale písik fíyooy nímeyiyoomeyi innicukoo.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" /><char style="w">Filip</char> naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, yísan unii Paapaa ya, eehuu efihifom unii.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yéesu naañahanoo apusokoo: “Filip, háati fa inci infiyye fa fiye naaluu, fo fiye awe míitam? An óo an eecukaam acukaacuk Paapaa ya, ooto weyme uwune ansok: 'Yísan unii Paapaa ya?' <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Fo áayinanut nii inci oopa ti Paapaa ya, Paapaa ya lompo náayemi ti inci? Kilim enka inci insok ka aluu kúfuliyoot ti inci himuumam, pale Paapaa ya eekine ya ti inci ayem ti íhinu páhin pa piteyoo. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Níyinanam niŋ inci sokaa nii, inci oopa ti Paapaa ya, Paapaa ya lompo oopa ti inci. Niŋ níyinanut kilim ka kutoom, níyinan kamma páhin empa inci ínhin pa. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, an óo an éeyinane ti inci, eeha inci iyyem ha ti íhinu, akina lompo áfanahin ho. Afánahin pihaŋ le kaatuko pati Paapaa ya inci inkaakaay. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Waah óo waah ewwa inniluume ti caacawam, inci fáhin wo, ancuk Añii ya áyisanaa hamake ha hiti Paapaa ya. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Niŋ niluumaam waah ti caacawam, inci fáhin wo.”<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu kakalaŋan ka kiteyoo kiti Kunuu ka keenape ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Yéesu nene asok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Niŋ nílafiyaam, éfinituul kilim ka kutoom keesiiŋanee ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Niŋ nílafiyaam, nítuul kilim ka kutoom keesiiŋanee ka.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Inci faluum Paapaa ya apuwufan aluu akee Ayankanana eekaakaay piyeno niŋ aluu fo cancowiyaaw. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Akina ayem <char style="w" lemma="Kunuu ka keenape ka">Kunuu</char> enka nkíyisan ka pakan paka pánipani ya, aŋa ammeya ya nii pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> kayinaatoo kasayan kamma nkacukutoo kámiitoo. Pale aluu, nímeyiyoomeyi kaatuko oopa niŋ aluu, afaakin taaluu. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Inci tikat aluu lammayaluu, fáñohoonii ti aluu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Etikamp pakati púlunta empe etinene kacukam. Pale aluu efinicukam kamma inci inkaakaay eloŋ, aluu lompo efiniloŋ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Etikamp pakati púlunta empe etinene kacukam, pale aluu efinicukam. Páawoo fa inci inkaakaay fa eloŋ, ekina efeewun aluu lompo inniloŋ.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Oom hinoom éfinimeyi nii inci oopa ti Paapaa atoom, aluu ínniyemi ti inci, inci lompo íyyemi ti aluu. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />An óo an eecoke kilim ka kutoom keesiiŋanee ka náatuul ko, oom an álafiyamlafi. An óo an éelafiyaam, Paapaa atoom áfaalafiyoo inci lompo fálafiyoo, íyyisanoolo teyoo.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Fiye Judas (neetaat Judas Iskaliyot) naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, puume áafayisanoolo toonii apan áatiyisanoolo ti púlunta pa?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yéesu naañahanoo apusokoo: “Niŋ an álafiyaam áfaatuul hilimam, Paapaa atoom áfaalafiyoo. Efúukey teyoo nuukin neyoo. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />An óo an éelafiitam átatuul hilimam. Kilim enka ínnisi ka, kutoom tom pale kiti Paapaa ya éepoñiyaam ya. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Eehuu púlooŋ inci insoke aluu ti waati eyye inci iyyem ye niŋ aluu. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Pale Ayankanana ya eeyem ya <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>, kikina Paapaa ya naakaakaay époñii ti caacawam, efikikalaŋan aluu waah óo waah, nkínawunan aluu enka púlooŋ inci insoke ka aluu. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Inci pikat aluu kásuumaay ka, kásuumaay ka kutoom inci iyyem aluu ti kawufan. Etiwufan ko aluu samat nii fa pakati púlunta pa nkawufan fa. Timpi niliim timpi nife. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Nísiyaasi fa inci insoke fa aluu nii: 'Inci pikaay, pale inci fáñohoonii.' Niŋ nílafiyaamlafi, anti niyeno ti pásuuma kamma inci iyyem ti pikaayu pati Paapaa ya, kaatuko Paapaa ya ahaŋaam. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Inci sokaasok ho aluu féefiye le niŋ enkuu efikitaako, ancuk niŋ kitaakiyaa, ínniyinan. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Káakupam naaluu etikimeeŋ kaatuko ati hikaw ha ati púlunta empe oopa ti ékey. Ayinaat waah ti inci, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />pale pakati púlunta pa kañaŋaa kameye nii, inci láfilafi Paapaa ya te eeha Paapaa ya nasokam ha, hikina inci nínhin. Nilito upukaayaa!”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yéesu enuun pánipani ya eti wiiñ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Yéesu nene asok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Inci yem enuun pánipani ya eti wiiñ ya, Paapaa atoom ayem amankoola punuun pa piti wiiñ ya. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kaanaay óo kaanaay keeyem ti inci apan kupukut, afaafiit ko. Pale kaanaay óo kaanaay keepuke, afaapentekal ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom “afaakuulan ko”.</char></note> kati kícepenii ancuk kupukaa pihaŋ toko. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Iyyema aluu, nipayeepa kaakuulan kamma hilim eeha inci insoke ha aluu. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Nitowo ti inci samat nii fa inci intowiye fa ti aluu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Inniyeniyaa ti inci, inci lompo fayeno ti aluu.”</char></note> Kaanaay lamma etenko kiyinaat hitaaku papukal niŋ kutowiit ti enuun ya. Fo lompo incuke ti aluu, niŋ nitowiit ti inci, eloŋ ya etaaluu etetaak papukal empa éfipusuum Pútuun pa. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Inci yem enuun ya eti wiiñ ya, aluu niyem unaay wa, niŋ an atowiyaa ti inci te inci intowo teyoo, oom an, eloŋ ya eteyoo efeetaak papukal peemeeŋe péesuume Pútuun pa, kaatuko niyinaat íhinu waah niŋ inci neetaat taaluu. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />An óo an eetowiit ti inci afaawantee tíkitaaŋ samat nii kaanaay keefiitee. Unaay ewwe efuusuucan niŋ fúlaa toko nuuyesee nuuwantee ti seemak upusowanee. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Niŋ nitowiyaa ti inci te kilim ka kutoom nkutowo taaluu, waah óo waah ewwa ínnilafiye, niluum, efinitaak wo. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Paapaa atoom fiye naakaakaayee kámakiyan: eloŋ ya etaaluu etaak papukal peemeeŋe inniyeno pinapana pa pakatoom.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “Niŋ eloŋ ya etaaluu etaakaa papukal peemeeŋe, Paapaa atoom áfaamakiyanee; fiyuu efiniyeno pinapana pa pakatoom.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Samat nii fa Paapaa ya náalafiyaam fa, fo lompo inci íllafiye aluu. Nitowo ti pálafi pa putoom. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Niŋ nítuulaa kilim ka kutoom keesiiŋanee ka efinitowo ti pálafi pa putoom, samat nii fa inci íntuule fa kilim ka kiti Paapaa atoom intowo ti pálafi pa piteyoo.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Inci sokaasok aluu eehuu, ancuk pásuuma empa inci intaake pa ti inci, aluu lompo innitaak po taaluu, pásuuma pa pitaaluu mpiyeno pásuuma pántoon. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Ehe hilim ha hitoom: nílafooli samat nii fa inci íllafiye fa aluu. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />An ayinaat pálafi an pihaŋ eewufane eloŋoo kamma pákawiyoo. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Niŋ níhinaa eeha inci insoke ha aluu, aluu pákawiyam. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Etinene yonkal aluu píhina pa pakatoom, kaatuko áhina ámeyiyantoo eeha áhampaatiin a ateyoo náhin. Inci yonkalaayonkal aluu pákawiyam, kaatuko eeha púlooŋ inci ínsiye ha ti Paapaa atoom sokaasok ho aluu. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Aluu tom nimamalaam, inci mamale aluu uwwufan aluu pitiyo kati nikaay, eloŋ ya etaaluu neetaak papukal, papukal empuu mputowo fo cancowiyaaw, ancuk waah óo waah ewwa inniluume Paapaa ya ti caacawam, afaawun wo aluu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ehe hilim ha hitoom: nílafooli.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Niŋ pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> kanataa aluu, nímeyi nii inci nkátikine kanat. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Niŋ aluu pakati púlunta pa, pakati púlunta pa anti kálafi aluu kamma inniyem pakoonool paka. Pale aluu pakati púlunta pa tom, inci mamale aluu ínkatinool aluu niŋ púlunta pa, ekina ewune pakati púlunta pa nkanat aluu. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Nínawuno hilim eeha inci insoke ha aluu, hisok: 'Amiikan ahaŋut áhampaatiin a ateyoo.' Niŋ kakallanaam efikakallan aluu lompo, niŋ kátuulaa kilim ka kutoom éfikatuul lompo kilim ka kitaaluu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Pale eehuu púlooŋ éfikahin ho aluu kamma inci, kaatuko kámiit éepoñiyaam ya. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Niŋ inci kéyyoot hínum, niŋ inci túunanutii hínum lompo hilim ha, anti kámuuyenaati. Pale fiye etikataak la éfikatii kati kafak ti umuuyen wa uteyii. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />An óo an eenataam, anataanat lompo Paapaa atoom. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Niŋ inci hínut hínum weecukantee ewwa an ataapala áhin, anti kámuuyenaati. Pale fiye, kacukaacuk apan nkanatam niŋ Paapaa atoom. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Pale heekiicee ha ti <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">hilim ha hiteyii heesiiŋanee ha</char> hitaakiyaa, hisok: <char style="qt">'Kanataam-nat pale kataakut la éfikatii kati kanatam.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Kícimu 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:5">69:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Inci fápoñii aluu Ayankanana ya éefulii ya pati Paapaa ya, <char style="w" lemma="Kunuu ka keenape ka">Kunuu</char> enka nkíyisan ka pakan paka pánipani ya. Niŋ kíkeyyoo, kikina efikiyeno eetantake ya atoom. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Aluu lompo efiniyeno keetantake ka pakatoom, kaatuko niyenaayeno niŋ inci kápiliŋ ti púcook.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Inci sokaasok aluu eehuu púlooŋ ancuk timpi níful ti káyinan enka innitaake ka ti inci. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Efikayaan aluu lompo ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa, caanak lompo unca ti ékey ta an eemuke aluu, facukoo nii páhin pa piti Pútuun pa naayaake. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Efíkahin eehuu kamma nkámiit Paapaa ya kámiitam lompo. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Pale inci sokaasok aluu eehuu ancuk niŋ caanak ca citeyii cícoliyoo, ínninawuno nii inci sokaasok ho aluu hínum. Sokut ho aluu ti púcook pa kaatuko inci oopa niŋ aluu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Páhin pa piti Kunuu ka keenape ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Yéesu nene asok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Pale fiye, pikaayu pati éepoñiyaam ya inci inkaakaay apan an ti aluu aneetaatam ti kacakan: 'Peyme ankaakaay?' <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Kamma eeha inci insoke ha aluu, saan aluu unsa simeeŋe kúnuul. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Pale pánipani ya inci iyyem aluu ti hisoku, haŋa panap ti aluu inci pikaay, kaatuko niŋ inci kaayut, Ayankanana ya átakey ti aluu. Pale niŋ inci kaayaa fápoñiyoo aluu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Niŋ ácoliyoo, áfaayisan pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> picaaŋ cataŋ nii, pilinco ti pámiiloolal pa piteyii nkayaake ti kiti kaamuuyen ka, kiti <char style="w">pucoonool</char> pa niŋ kiti kíiti ya eti Pútuun pa. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Pilinco nkayaake kiti kaamuuyen ka, kamma nkáyinanut ti inci. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Pilinco nkayaake kiti pucoonool pa, kamma inci inkaakaay pati Paapaa ya etinene nicukam. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Pilinco nkayaake kiti kíiti ya, kamma ati hikaw ha ati púlunta empe naasiiŋanee ti pisiya.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Waah weemeeŋe inci intaake uti hisoku aluu pale éfuunapi ti aluu fiye. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kunuu ka keenape ka">Kunuu</char> enka nkíyisan ka pakan paka pánipani ya kíkeyyoo, éfikitintiŋan aluu ti pánipani ya púlooŋ. Kaatuko héefulii ha tenko tom nkúkup pale eeha nkísiye ha púlooŋ, hikina efinkusok aluu, nkikaman aluu heekaakaay ékey. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Káyisan hamake ha hitoom nkikaakaay kaatuko efinkusok aluu eeha nkisaye ha ti inci. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Waah óo waah uti Paapaa ya utoom, ekina ewune inci insok aluu nii Kunuu ka kiti pánipani ya efinkusok aluu eeha nkisaye ha ti inci.”<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kúnuul niŋ pásuuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Yéesu nene asok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Le niŋ caanak ceetama etinene nicukam, niŋ fúlaa toko le niŋ cikee caanak ceetama nene nicukam.” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Fiye pakakee ti pinapana pa pakateyoo nkayeno picakanool: “Weyme náalafiye hisoku: 'Le niŋ caanak ceetama etinicukam, niŋ fúlaa toko le niŋ cikee caanak ceetama nene nicukam'? Weyme náalafiye hisoku lompo: 'Kaatuko inci pikaayu pati Paapaa ya'?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Pinapana pa nene kasokool: “Weyme uyem 'caanak ceetama'? Umíit weyme náalafiye hisoku.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yéesu náameyi nii pinapana pa kálafiyoolafi kacakan, naasokii: “Fo picakanool inniyaake kiti eeha inci insoke ha? Inci sok: 'Le niŋ caanak ceetama etinicukam, niŋ fúlaa toko le niŋ cikee caanak ceetama nene nicukam.' <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, efinikooŋ innisampoolo, tempo pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> ti pahaaño. Efiniyeno ti kúnuul pale kúnuul ka kitaaluu efikiyeso pásuuma. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Aal, íyyiŋooliyoo, afaayeno ti kúnuul kamma waatiyoo néetuuniye. Pale niŋ apukaa atanene ánawuno ñíseeña ña ñiteyoo kaatuko súumoosuum kamma naapuke añii. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Fo lompo incuke taaluu: aluu unka ti kúnuul fiye, pale inci fanene cuk aluu. Tempo efiniyeno ti pásuuma apan an atanene áfulan aluu tempo. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Oom hinoom etinene niluumam waah. Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, niŋ niluumaa waah Paapaa ya ti caacawam, afaawun wo aluu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: “niŋ niluumaa waah Paapaa ya, afaawun wo aluu ti caacawam.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Fo fiye niloot niluum waah ti caacawam. Niluum efinitaak, ancuk pásuuma pa pitaaluu piyeniyaa pásuuma pántoon.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Eehuu púlooŋ niŋ kícantiitu inci insoke ho aluu. Pale caanak unca ti ékey ta inci etinene kúp niŋ aluu niŋ kícantiitu, pale fákup niŋ aluu picaaŋ cataŋ kiti Paapaa ya. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Oom hinoom ti caacawam efiniluum; inci neetaat ti hisoku aluu nii, faluum Paapaa atoom kiti aluu. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Kaatuko Paapaa ya himuumoo, álafilafi aluu kamma ínnilafiyaam ínniyinan nii pati Pútuun pa inci ínfulii. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Pati Paapaa ya inci ínfulii píkey ti púlunta pa, fiye inci fáful ti púlunta pa pikaay pati Paapaa ya.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Pinapana pa pakateyoo nkasokoo: “Iyyoo, fiye áakupaa niŋ unii picaaŋ cataŋ áakuput niŋ unii niŋ kícantiitu. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Uméyimeyi fiye nii áameyimeyi waah óo waah, aasoolahut an apicakani. Ekina ewune núuyinan nii pati Pútuun pa ánfulii.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Fo níyinanaayinan fiye silaŋ? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Nísiitan! Caanak unca ti ékey, cícoliyoocol fala, ta efinihancaloolo, an óo an naayet pateyoo innikatam lamayam. Pale etiyeno lamayam kaatuko Paapaa ya oopa niŋ inci. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Inci sokaasok aluu eehuu púlooŋ kati nitaak kásuumaay ti inci. Ti púlunta empe efiniyeno ti kúnuul, pale nísik piliit! Inci heekaaheek púlunta pa.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Kaluum ka kiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yéesu ta naapaye ta káakup, náahaafin, naasok: “Paapaa, colaa toko, yísan pakan paka hamake ha hiti añiini, ancuk añii ya áyisanii hamake ha hitii. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kaatuko awe ufanoo sempe ti pakan paka púlooŋ, ancuk awufanaa eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya pakan paka púlooŋ payenka awwufanoo ka. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya eyem kameyeyi, awe Pútuun pa poonool pa piti pánipani ya niŋ aŋa ámpoñii ya, Yéesu Krista. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Inci yísanaayisan hamake ha hitii ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>, kaatuko payaapa páhin empa awwufanaam pa kati hín. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Fiye Paapaa, mákiyanam hátikini, niŋ hamake eeha inci intaake ha naawe le niŋ púlunta pa efipiliilee.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Pakan paka payenka ammamale ka ti púlunta pa uwwufanamii, inci híniihin kápimeyiyi. Kayenaayeno pakatii, aawufanaamii, nkátuul hilim ha hitii. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Fiye kámeyimeyi nii waah óo waah ewwa awwufanaam, ti awe núufulii. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Kaatuko kilim enka awwufanaam ka, inci sokiisok ko nkacoon ko. Nkámeyi nii pánipani ti awe inci ínfulii, nkáyinan nii awe póñiyaam. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Inci luumuu kiteyii, luumut kiti pakati púlunta pa pale kiti pakan paka payenka awwufanaam ka, kaatuko pakatii. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Waah óo waah utoom utii, samat nii fa waah óo waah utii nuuyem fa utoom, hamake ha hitoom níhiyisanee pínapii teyii. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Etinene yeno ti púlunta empe, pale poko ti púlunta pa efikayeno, inci ékey puu ti awe. Paapaa ya eenape yuu, mankoolii ti caacawi enca awwufanaam ca, ancuk samat nii fa immaayemaa fa an oonool poko lompo nkayeno an oonool. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ta inci iyyeniye ta niŋ poko, inci yeniyii kaamankool ti caacawi enca awwufanaam ca. Faasiifaas, an teyii ácimut niŋ fúlaa eeñaŋe ya hícimu ancuk heekiicee ha hitaakiyaa. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Fiye ékey pati awe iyyaake pale eehuu inci insoke le niŋ inci fáful ti púlunta pa, ancuk pásuuma empa inci intaake pa ti inci, poko lompo kataakaa po teyii pántoon. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Inci ufaniiwufan hilim ha hitii, púlunta pa mpinatii, kaatuko samat nii fa inci inneetaat fa ati púlunta pa, poko lompo fo nkaneetaat pakati púlunta pa. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Luumuti aakati fúlanii ti púlunta pa, pale aakati mankoolii ti áhampaatiin a ati <char style="w" lemma="Seetaani">piseetaani</char> pa. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Kaneetaat pakati púlunta pa samat nii fa inci inneetaat fa ati púlunta pa. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Hín eloŋ ya eteyii púlooŋ epiyeno etii pínapii ti pánipani ya. Hilimi hiyem pánipani ya. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Samat nii fa ámpoñiyaam fa ti púlunta pa, fo lompo inci impoñii ti púlunta pa. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Kamma poko inci uwwufanuu eloŋam púlooŋ, ancuk poko lompo, eloŋii púlooŋ eyeniyaa etii pínapii ti pánipani ya.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Luumuti kiti pinapana pa payenkuu lamma, pale kiti pakan paka lompo keekaakaay ka káyinan ti inci niŋ kásiyaa kilim ka kiteyii. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Paapaa, inci oopa ti kaluum kati kayeno poko púlooŋ an oonool; samat nii fa ayyem fa ti inci, inci lompo íyyemi ti awe, álimaati poko lompo kayeno ti anii. Fiyuu pakan paka pakati púlunta pa éfikayinan nii awe póñiyaam. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Inci uwwufanii hamake eeha awwufanaam ha kati kayeno an oonool samat nii anii, <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />inci íyyemi teyii, awe íyyemi ti inci, ekina kati ewun nkayeno an oonool pántoon, ancuk púlunta pa pimeya nii awe póñiyaam íllafiyii samat nii fa állafiyaam fa. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Paapaa, láfilafi pa inci iyyem pa, payenka awwufanaam ka lompo nkayeno po niŋ inci, kati nkacuk hamake eeha awwufanaam ha kamma állafiyaam le niŋ púlunta pa efipiliilee. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Paapaa, awe <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">eecoonoole</char> ya, pakati púlunta pa kámiiti pale inci méyiyuumeyi, pinapana pa pakatoom nkámeyi nii awe póñiyaam. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Híniihin kápimeyi caacawi, fáhinii kápimeyi co pihaŋ toko, ancuk pálafi empa áyyisanaam pa piyeniyaa teyii, inci íyyemi teyii.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Hicokuyee ha hiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Ta Yéesu naapaye ta kaluum, naañak niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo nkafiitan hiyanu ha heesooŋe ha hiti Ketulon. Toko intaak kankaŋ, Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo nkanako teyyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Caham Judas, eekaakaay ya hífulu teyoo, ámeyimeyi toko kamma Yéesu naloom po pikaayu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Fiye Judas naakaay ti kankaŋ ya, naanapool niŋ kayoŋ kiti pusoocaali pakati <char style="w">Room</char>, poko niŋ pufaasa pakati <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, payenka <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkapoñe ka. Nkayekan pilampi, kiwiit niŋ pucoolaŋ. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yéesu náameyi waah óo waah weekaakaayoo pitaako, fiye naalohii naacakanii: “Ayme inniyem ti hiŋes?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Nkañahanoo: “Yéesu ati Naasalet.” Yéesu naasokii: “Inci yem akina.” Judas, eeyem ya ti hífulu teyoo, naasiiŋo toko neyii. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ta Yéesu naasokii ta nii: “Inci yem akina,” nkañako puson nkanowal. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yéesu nene acakanii: “Ayme inniyem ti hiŋes?” Nkañahanoo: “Yéesu ati Naasalet.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yéesu naasokii: “Inci sokaasok aluu nii inci yem akina. Iyyema inci inniyem ti hiŋes ooto nikatan payenke kapikaay.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Eehuu hitaakaataako ancuk eeha naasoke ha kati hitaako. Asok: “Paapaa, inci púulut háati oonool ti payenka awwufanaam ka.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char> náañakii káakuntu ka kiteyoo, naafiit cat kaanuu káali ka kiti amiikan a ati awaaseena ya enfakat a. Amiikan a caacawoo Malukus. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yéesu naasok Piyeer: “Ñahan káakuntu ka ti kaahoonu etenko! Fo inci etilaan elontoŋ ya eti kúnuul ka enka Paapaa atoom naawufanaam ka?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hicoopuyee ha hiti Yéesu pati Annas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Fiye pusoocaali pa pakati <char style="w">Room</char> niŋ áhampaatiin a ateyii, poko niŋ pufaasa pa pakati <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, nkacok Yéesu nkacenkoo. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Nkátikin kacoopoo pati Annas eeyem ya paapaa ati Kayif aaloo. Oom Kayif ayem <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa</char> ti oom etiil. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Akina awune kunuu hínum pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nii, haŋa panap an oonool apiket kamma pakan paka.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeer píyaañoo káalaacin Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char> niŋ akee anapana, nkanapan Yéesu. Oom anapana, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya enfakat</char> a ati Pútuun pa ámeyiyoomeyi, ekina ewune naanako niŋ Yéesu ti hank ha hiti awaaseena ya enfakat a, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />pale Piyeer naatowo tíkitaaŋ hunkut ha. Fiye akee anapana ya, aŋa awaaseena ya enfakat a naameya ya, naañoho tíkitaaŋ, náakup niŋ amiikan a aal a aŋa nafaas a hunkut ha, náanakanii Piyeer páhantuwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Oom aal naasok Piyeer: “Fo awe neetaat lompo akee ti pinapana pa pakati áyiin aŋuu?” Piyeer naañahanoo: “Haani, inci neetaat.” <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Inhemool pimiikan pa niŋ pufaasa pa pakati <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> kacokanaa kíceket, nkákiipool ko kasiiŋ kapiyeno písimo kamma immone. Piyeer naasiiŋo neyii apiyeno lompo písimo.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaacakanoolee ka kiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa</char> naacakan Yéesu kiti pinapana pa pakateyoo niŋ pakalaŋanaloo. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Inci hátikin pakan paka inci ínkup tan óo tan, ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa niŋ ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> inci inkalaŋan, la <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa púlooŋ nkapaakool la. Inci taapala sok waah ti piyolo. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Weyme uwune ancakanam? Cakan pakan paka kéesiyaam ka eeha inci insokii ha, kámeyimeyi picaaŋ cataŋ eeha inci insoke ha.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ta Yéesu naasoke ta eehuu, akee ti pufaasa pa keesiiŋiye ka toko naahankoo kapal naasokoo: “Awe háañiye kañahan fiyaaw awaaseena ya enfakat a!” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Niŋ heenaput inci ínkupe, sok ho le an óo an, pale niŋ heenape inci insoke weyme uwune ansapam?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Fiye Annas naasok kacoop Yéesu pati Kayif, awaaseena ya enfakat a, sipeesoo insiloŋ insicenkee.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeer káalaacin ka kiteyoo kúsupiyenu ka niŋ kíhaaciyenu ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ta eehuu nihiyeniye ta pitaako, Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naaloŋ naasiiŋiye toko ti písimo. Fiye pakakee paka nkasokoo: “Fo awe neetaat lompo akee ti pinapana pa pakateyoo?” Pale Piyeer náalaacin naasokii: “Haani, inci neetaat.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Akee ti pimiikan pa pakati <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya enfakat a</char>, eepukee niŋ áyiin a aŋa Piyeer naafiite ya kaanuuwoo, naacakanoo: “Fo inci cukuti neyoo ti kankaŋ ya?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Piyeer nene asok: “Haani.” Tokotoko káayiin ekutoon nkúlookii.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu hátikin Pilaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Púful toko, pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa nkáfulan Yéesu ti ekumpaan ya eti Kayif nuulap kapucoopoo pati ékinuma ya eti <char style="w">Pilaat</char>, ati hikaw ha ati mah ma. Pale poko, kanakiit ti ékinuma ya kaatuko, niŋ kanakiyaa ti ekumpaan eti eeneetaat Asuwif efikacokee nii pakan keekuulut. Fiyuu étikayini hili káciim ka kiti pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char>. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ekina ewune Pilaat náafulii naacakanii: “Eeheyme inninooke áyiin a aŋe?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Nkañahanoo: “Anti úcoopiyaatiyoo peti awe niŋ áhinut heenaput.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilaat naasokii: “Aluu faŋ aluu nicoopoo íncanihinoo kíiti ti <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">hilim ha hitaaluu heesiiŋanee ha</char>.” Nkañahanoo: “Uwufanutee sempe kati úyini himuku an.”<verse eid="JHN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Eehuu hitaakaataako ancuk eeha Yéesu naasoke ha kiti fa naakaakaay fa eket hitaakiyaa. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Fiye Pilaat naañoho páhantuwa ekumpaan ya eteyoo, naayonkal Yéesu, naacakanoo: “Fo awe yem amansa ya ati Pusuwif pa?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Kacakan enkuu, ti awe nkúfulii fo pakakee kasokuu kutoom?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilaat naañahanoo: “Fo inci Asuwif? Pakani niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin ña puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> pitaaluu kácoopiyuu ti inci kati híni kíiti. Eeheyme ánhine?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yéesu naasokoo: “<char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> ca citoom citi <char style="w" lemma="Púlunta pa">púlunta</char> empe tom. Niŋ cáwii ca citoom citi púlunta empe, pimiikan pa pakatoom anti kátaakool kapikitam kawufanee pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa. Haani, cáwii ca citoom citi le tom!” <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Fiye Pilaat naacakanoo: “Ooto awe amansa?” Yéesu naañahanoo: “Awe soke nii inci amansa. Heewune ha inci ínkey ti púlunta pa hiyem: káakup picaaŋ cataŋ kiti pánipani ya. Ekina ewune inci impukee. An óo an eeyem ti pánipani ya násiitanam-síitan.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilaat naacakanoo: “Weyme uyem pánipani ya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Fiye Pilaat naañoho tíkitaaŋ ti Pusuwif pa naasokii: “Inci cukut heewune áyiin a aŋe kati asiiŋanee ti pisiya. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Pale ti cosaan ya eti aluu, inkatankatan aluu eekulee ti pahaaño pa piti Himuusu ha. Fo nílafilafi pikatan aluu amansa ya ati Pusuwif pa?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Nkañahanoo ti hiceeku: “Haani, akina tom! Pale Palapas núulafiye!” Apan Palapas akanca.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s">Ihínuyee ha kíiti Yéesu apipempeŋee ti kuluwaa ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Fiye <char style="w">Pilaat</char> naawufan hilim kapucoop Yéesu nkasapaloo fanfaŋ niŋ kisawut. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Pusoocaali pa nkacoop mífiitiin miti pícankun nkaliil mo samat nii éwuulu eti amansa, nkasoof yo ti hikaw Yéesu, nkásooloo lompo hísool henfakat héecunke hiti amansa. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Nkatowo ti ékey teyoo nkasokoo: “Ukicanuu, awe amansa ya ati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa!” Nkayeniyoo kaafantal.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilaat nene áfulii naasok Pusuwif pa: “Nisincan, inci púfulaniyoo aluu tíkitaaŋ, ancuk nimeya nii inci cukut teyoo heewune kati asiiŋanee ti pisiya.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Fiye Yéesu náafulii niŋ éwuulu ya eti pícankun pa ti hikawoo niŋ hísool ha henfakat ha héecunke ha. Pilaat naasokii: “Ehe áyiin a!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ pufaasa <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, emma nkacukoo ma nkayeno hiceeku: “Pempeŋoo ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>! Pempeŋoo ti kuluwaa!” Pale, Pilaat naasokii: “Nicoopoo aluu himuum aluu innipempeŋoo ti kuluwaa, kaatuko inci cukut heewune kati asiiŋanee ti pisiya.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa nkasokoo: “Utaakaataak <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">hilim heesiiŋanee</char>, ti oom hilim naañaŋee himuku kamma naasoke nii akina ayem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Ta Pilaat náasiye ta eehuu naahaŋ toko naafeye. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Naañahan Yéesu páhantuwa naacakanoo: “Awe ati peyme?” Pale Yéesu añahanutoo. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Fiye Pilaat naasokoo: “Aálafiitam kañahan? Fo áamiit nii inci taakaataak kayine kiti kakatani niŋ ekina tom kiti kaapempeŋi ti kuluwaa?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Niŋ neetaat kawun kéekeyii ti awe kúpufulii patiila, anti táakaati sempe ti inci. Ekina ewune aŋa éecoopiyaam ya apuwufanami, naahaŋi kaamuuyen.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Tempo Pilaat náayaañ hiŋes kakatanoo, pale pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa nkatowo ti hiceeku nkasok: “Niŋ aakatanaa áyiin a aŋe ooto aaneetaat niŋ Amansa ya enfakat a ati <char style="w">Room</char>. An óo an eecokooliye nii amansa, akamool Amansa ya enfakat a.” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Ta Pilaat náasiye ta kilim enkuu náafulan Yéesu tíkitaaŋ. Púful toko naakaayeno ti híkon ha hiti éhinuma kíiti ya, la nkasok la “Kapata” ti kaŋ ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Ahiburu">Hiburu</char>, toko lompo nkasok “híliŋ heepupee niŋ pínankiin”.<verse eid="JHN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Hinoom eehuu hiyeniye hinoom ha hiti ememanoolo ya le niŋ pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char>, tempo caanak ca ti kikaw. Fiye, Pilaat naasok Pusuwif pa: “Ehe amansa ya ataaluu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Pale nkayeno hiceeku: “Aket! Aket! Pempeŋoo ti kuluwaa!” Pilaat naasokii: “Fo inci pempeŋ amansa ya ataaluu?” Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa nkañahanoo: “Utaakut akee amansa niŋ fúlaa Amansa ya enfakat a ati Room.” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Ti pikelan Pilaat náahin eeha nkálafiye ha naawufan Yéesu kati apempeŋee ti kuluwaa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Kaapempeŋee ka kiti Yéesu ti kuluwaa ya</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Fiye nkacoop Yéesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yéesu himuumoo akantiye <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya eteyoo, náaful ti saatee ya apuwant la nkasok la Esent. Ti kaŋ ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Ahiburu">Hiburu</char> nkasok toko “Golgota”. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Toko nkapempeŋoo niŋ pakakee pákasupak, akee ya ti epeesoo yaamay, akee ya epeesoo yáali, Yéesu ti pututa. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" /><char style="w">Pilaat</char> naapoñ kapikiic ti kaapapaloo hilim eehe: <char style="sc">Yéesu Ati Naasalet, Amansa Ya Ati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> Pa.</char> Nkipempeŋee ti kuluwaa ya eteyoo. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Pusuwif keemeeŋe kakalaŋaakalaŋ oom pakiical kaatuko la Yéesu naapempeŋee la láaŋut saatee ya, apan pakiical pa ti pikaŋ pa piti Hiburu, Latin niŋ Kilek mpikiicee. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" /><char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena</char> Pusuwif pa nkasok Pilaat: “Timpi kiic 'Amansa ya ati Pusuwif pa' pale aañaŋaa hikiicu: 'Ayíin aŋe asok: akina ayem amansa ya ati Pusuwif pa.'” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilaat naañahanii: “Eeha inci inkiice ha, kiicaakiic ho fo pa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ta pusoocaali pa nkapaye ta kaapempeŋ Yéesu, nkacoop wañ wa uteyoo nkápaacinool wo kimpaac kipaakiil, an óo an teyii hoonool. Nkacoop hísool ha hiteyoo heehaane ha, hicifutee pale heeliilee kápiliŋ patiila fo t’etaam. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Pusoocaali pa nkasokool: “Timpi uhaacaa ho pale uñakaa kaakaaw úpumeyiyaa ayme afaacoop ho.” Fiyuu heekiicee ha ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nihitaakiye, hisok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">
    <char style="qt">“Kápaacinoolaa-páacinool wañ wa utoom </char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">
    <char style="qt">nkañak kaakaaw kúsool ka kutoom.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:18">Kícimu 22:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
  </para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Eehuu pusoocaali pa nkáhine.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Fiye, pukol kuluwaa ya eti Yéesu, íññaa ateyoo oopa asiiŋiye niŋ íññaa ateyoo atuwoo, Kolopas aaloo <char style="w">Mari</char> niŋ Mari ati Makatala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Ta Yéesu naacuke ta íññaa ateyoo niŋ anapana ya ateyoo aŋa náalafiye ya naasiiŋiye pukoloo, naasok íññaa ateyoo: “Aaluu, ehe añiini.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Púful toko naasok anapana ya: “Ehe íññaa atii.” Písik ti hinoom eehuu, anapana ya naacoopoo lateyoo.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eket ya eti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Eehuu hipimuus, Yéesu náameyi nii waah utowiit, heekiicee ha ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> kati hitaako, naasok: <char style="qt">“Pálaani pucokaam!”</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:15">Kícimu 22:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:21">69:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Pukol toko intaako élumpa kaameeŋ elaan eesipe, pusoocaali pa nkápuuc toko cífiitiin epons nkacenk co ti hikasap héefulii ti ekee enuun eyya nkasok “hisop”, nkáseepin ho fo ti putumoo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yéesu naasoop elaan ya eesipe ya naasok: “Waah utowiit.” Púful toko náaŋok naasuuŋut pikelan.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu hiyayuyee ha hiteyoo ti kaheh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Ti hinoom ha hiti ememanoolo ya le niŋ <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> hiti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa Yéesu naakete. Pakati kikaw ka pakati Pusuwif pa kálafiit ehunuŋ ya eputowo ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka, kaatuko hinoom eehuu hiyenaayeno pahaaño penfakat. Nkakaay pati <char style="w">Pilaat</char> nkaluumoo ahumalool wootii kati kaket picas, puhunuŋ pa mpúwananiyee. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Fiye pusoocaali pa nkákey nkahumal woot ácook a ti keepempeŋee ka niŋ Yéesu, nkáhin fo lompo uti ásupiyenu ya. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Pale kapucol ti Yéesu nkatook loho apayaa eket, kahumut wootoo. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Háati fo fiya, akee ti pusoocaali pa naayayoo ti kaheh niŋ epaay ya eteyoo, tokotoko hísim niŋ man úmmufulii. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Eekamane ya eehuu atantakaatantak ho. Eeha naakamane ha hiti pánipani te ámeyimeyi nii eeha naasoke ha hiti páni, ancuk aluu lompo níyinanaa. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Eehuu púlooŋ hitaakaataako ancuk heekiicee ha ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> hitaakiyaa, hisok: <char style="qt">“Háati kaacecoo koonool etikuhumo.”</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Efúlii 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Pafinal 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Kícimu 34:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Nihisok lompo: <char style="qt">“Efikasincan aŋa nkayaye ya.”</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Sakaliya 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehok ya eti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Púful toko, <char style="w">Josef</char> ati saatee ya eti Alimataay eeyem a lompo anapana ati Yéesu ti piyolo kamma naafeye pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, naakaay pati <char style="w">Pilaat</char>. Naaluumoo ehunuŋ ya eti Yéesu kati acaahok yo. Pilaat naacoon, Josef náacaacoopii ehunuŋ ya. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodem naanapool neyoo. Akina mpáakey ti Yéesu níhanant.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Saŋ 3:1-2</ref></char></note> Fiye, náacoopoolii munucu méesuume haaw emma nkamemanoole niŋ miir niŋ alowes, máamun sikilo áwii niŋ ŋaasuwan (30). <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Poko t’ésupakii nkacoop ehunuŋ ya eti Yéesu nkakuupool yo niŋ munucu ma samat nii fa Pusuwif pa nkáhin fa ti cosaan ya eteyii káhokum. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />La nkapempeŋe la Yéesu, kankaŋ uyya toko, ti oom kankaŋ intaak hiyaak héeyeeni, an ataapala ahokee teeho. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Toko nkahoke Yéesu páawoo haŋa pálike, iyyeno hinoom hiti ememanoolo le niŋ <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char> hiti Pusuwif pa.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Elítoonii ya eti Yéesu ti eket ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Timaas ya mpucom mic loho loŋaa ínnime, <char style="w">Mari</char> ati saatee ya eti Makatala naakaay pati hiyaak ha. Apucol naacuk nii énankiin ya eepantane ya hiyaak ha épalinkanee-pálinkan. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Naatey pati Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char> niŋ akee ti pinapana pa, aŋa Yéesu náalafiye ya, naasokii: “Ehunuŋ ya eti Ahámpaatiin a éfulaneefulan ti hiyaak ha, úmiit peyme neeyenanee.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Fiye Piyeer niŋ akee anapana ya nkáful kapikaay pati hiyaak ha. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Nkatey ti coonool, pale akee anapana ya ahaŋa Piyeer katey. Náatikinoo hicolu pati hiyaak ha. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Naañeeho ápucuuhan, naaŋantan kahuuy ka kiti kahok ka páhantuwa hiyaak ha pale anakiit lupo. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Púful toko, Simon Piyeer lompo náacolii, naanako páhantuwa hiyaak ha naacuk kahuuy ka lupo. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Cifaal enca nkakuupatanoole ca hikaw Yéesu incipoonee citeete etenco, ciyeniit niŋ kahuuy ka. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Fiye akee anapana ya éetikine ya ácolii naalompo anako ti hiyaak ha, naacuk náayinan. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />(Kaatuko pinapana pa, heekiicee ha ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> hiloot hicaaŋ teyii, hisok nii, Yéesu fo álitoonii ti eket ya.) <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Púful toko pinapana pa nkañoho pateyii.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efúlii ya eti Yéesu ti Mari ati Makatala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Ta pinapana pa nkayeniye ta puñoho, <char style="w">Mari</char> naasiiŋo apiyeno pukooŋ tíkitaaŋ hiyaak ha. Akina ti pukooŋ pa, naañeeho apiyeno káacuuhan páhantuwa hiyaak ha. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Naacuk <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">simaleekoo</char> súsupak seewasiye wañ weehiina paŋ, insiyeno kayen la nkahintane la ehunuŋ ya eti Yéesu, ekee ya pati hikaw ha, ekee ya pati woot wa. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Insicakanoo: “Aaluu, weyme ankooŋ?” Naañahan so: “Ehunuŋ ya eti Ahámpaatiin a atoom nkacoope, míit peyme nkayenane yo.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Akina ti hisoku ha eehuu naayeso naacuk Yéesu naasiiŋiye toko pale ámiit nii akina. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Aaluu, weyme ankooŋ? Ayme aŋŋes?” Mari incukoo nii áhina ya ati kankaŋ ya, naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, iyyema awe coope ehunuŋ ya insokam peyme ayyenane yo, inci ínkaacoopii yo.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Mari.” Mari naayeso apucoonool neyoo, naasokoo ti kaŋ ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Ahiburu">Hiburu</char>: “Rabuni” (ekina eyem “Akalaŋana eemaka”). <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Timpi cokam! Kaatuko inci loot silo fala pati Paapaa ya. Awe ñoho pati pákawiyam insokii nii, inci pisilo pati Paapaa atoom eeyem ya lompo Paapaa ataaluu, pati Pútuun pa putoom peeyem pa lompo Pútuun pa pitaaluu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mari ati Makatala naakaay pati pinapana pa naasokii: “Inci cukaacuk Ahámpaatiin a!” Náatuunanii eeha Ahámpaatiin a naasokoo ha.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu éfulii ya eteyoo ti pinapana pa pakateyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Timaas eyyuu nkániim ka, pinapana pa nkaconcoolo nantoonool nkakuloolo ti ekumpaan kamma nkafeye pakati kikaw ka pakati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa. Fiye, Yéesu náafulii ti pututayii naasokii: “Aluu kásuumaay!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ta naasoke ta eehuu, náayisanii sipeesoo niŋ kahehoo. Pinapana pa ta nkacuke ta Ahámpaatiin a nkayeno ti pásuuma. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Fiye Yéesu nene asokii: “Aluu kásuumaay! Samat nii fa Paapaa ya náapoñiyaam fa, fo lompo inci iyyem aluu ti hipoñu. Kásuumaay kiyeno naaluu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ta naapaye ta hisoku eehuu náafuuteen teyii naasokii: “Nisa <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />An óo an aŋa inniponkete umuuyen wa uteyoo, afaaponketee. An óo an aŋa inniponketut umuuyen wa uteyoo, ataponketee.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ Tomas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tempo Tomas aŋa nkasok a lompo Máasupak ma, akee ti ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka, ayeniit toko ta Yéesu náakeyii ta. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Ta náañohoonii ta pakakee pinapana pa nkasokoo: “Ucukaacuk Ahámpaatiin a!” Pale naañahanii: “Niŋ inci cukut háakum ha hiti ufincu wa ti sipeesoo innaŋ hisiikam ti háakum ufincu wa, innaŋ epeesam ti kahehoo, étiyinan.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Kunoom isak niŋ káhaaciil kupumuus, pinapana pa nene kaconcoolo ti ekumpaan ya, tempe Tomas toko. Loho kunkut ka kukulee, Yéesu náafulii ti pututayii naasokii: “Aluu kásuumaay!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Fiye, naasok Tomas: “Naŋ le hisiiki, sincan sipeesam, ñáakanii epeesi innaŋ yo ti kaheham, katan hitaaku kunuu kúsupak, íyyinan.” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomas naañahanoo: “<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> atoom niŋ Pútuun pa putoom!” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Kamma ancukaam ekina ewune áyyinan, kéeyinane ka peecukutam kataakaa pásuuma.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Heewune ha púkoo eyye neekiicee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yéesu áhinaahin hícump pikee píyisan hátikin pinapana pa pakateyoo peekiicutee ti púkoo eyye. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Pale peekiicee pa le, pikiiceekiic kati níyinan nii Yéesu ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char>, Añii ya ati Pútuun pa, te niŋ níyinanaa efinitaak eloŋ ya ti caacawoo.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Eyísanoolo ya eti Yéesu ti kantant ka kiti han ha hiti Tipeliyas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Eehuu hipimuus, Yéesu nene áfulii ti pinapana pa pakateyoo pati han ha hiti Tipeliyas. Fiye nihitaakiye. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Pinapana pa payenke kayeniye nantoonool: Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char>, Tomas aŋa nkasok a Máasupak ma, Natanayel éefulii ya Kana eti <char style="w">Galilee</char> niŋ Sepete epuukoo, niŋ pakakee pinapana pákasupak pakati Yéesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simon Piyeer naasokii: “Inci pikaayu calafayi.” Nkañahanoo: “Unii efuunapani.” Fiye nkakaay nkáyuuko ti piteen, pale hánant eehuu púlooŋ kacokut waah.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Mpucom pa mic, Yéesu naasiiŋo ti kantant ka pale pinapana pa kámiit nii akina. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Fiye naacakanii: “Pákawiyam, fo nícokiyoot waah?” Nkañahanoo: “Háati waah.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Naasokii: “Nitah cala ya etaaluu ti epees yáali piteen pa, efinicok.” Fiye nkatah cala ya kayinaat yo éñakii kamma neecoke hícump soon. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Anapana ya aŋa Yéesu náalafiye ya naasok Piyeer: “Aŋuu Ahámpaatiin a!” Ta Simon Piyeer náasiye ta nii aŋuu Ahámpaatiin a, naawaso hísool ha hiteyoo, kaatuko awaatoolaa-waatoolo, naawantoolo ti man ma. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Pakakee pinapana pa nkayeno éciŋii niŋ piteen pa kápiñakiiñak cala ya eemeeŋe ya soon. Kálaaŋut kantant ka, máamun simeetal keme (100).<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ta nkáciŋii ta, nkacuk seemak siti kíceket, soon ínsiyemiyee toko ti pusowu niŋ kúmpuul. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Fiye Yéesu naasokii: “Nícoopii ti soon sa sitaaluu ensa ínnicokii sa féefiye.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simon Piyeer náayuuko ti piteen pa náañakii cala ya eemeeŋe ya soon senfakat ti kantant ka. Soon sa senfakat sa siyema keme niŋ áwii ésupak niŋ ŋaasuwan niŋ síhaaciil (153). Háati fa insimeeŋe fa, cala ya ehaaciit. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yéesu naasokii: “Níkey hili ecoma.” An ti pinapana pa áhaañiitoo kacakan: “Awe yem ayme?” Kaatuko kámeyimeyi nii akina ayem Ahámpaatiin a. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Fiye Yéesu naalohii, naacoop kúmpuul ka naawufanii, náahin moonool muu niŋ soon sa. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Empuu piyem píhaaciyenu ta Yéesu náafulii ti pinapana pa pakateyoo palitaliyoo ti eket ya.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ Piyeer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ta nkapaye ta hili, Yéesu naasok Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char>: “Simon añii ya ati <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, fo áalafiyaamlafi aapihaŋ payenke?” Naañahanoo: “Ee, Ahámpaatiin, áameyimeyi nii inci láfiyuulafi.” Yéesu naasokoo: “Ufan mísaacii ma mutoom mipili.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yéesu naasokoo púsupiyenu: “Simon añii ya ati Saŋ, fo áalafiyaamlafi?” Naañahanoo: “Ee, Ahámpaatiin, áameyimeyi nii inci láfiyuulafi.” Yéesu naasokoo: “Mankool písaacii pa putoom.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yéesu naasokoo píhaaciyenu: “Simon añii ya ati Saŋ, fo áalafiyaamlafi?” Piyeer ínciitiyoo kamma Yéesu naacakanoo fo ñiyema ñáhaaciil: “Fo áalafiyaamlafi?” Fiye naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, áameyimeyi waah óo waah, áameyimeyi nii inci láfiyuulafi!” Yéesu naasokoo: “Ufan písaacii pa putoom pipili. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Inci pusoki pánipani ya, ta ayyeniye ta ti hikampaanateyi, ánsoolosoolo inkaay pan óo pan pa állafiye, pale naamaamanaa, áafapantin sipeesi akee náasooli naacoopi pa állafiit pa pikaayu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />(Yéesu asokaasok eehuu ápiyisan fa Piyeer naakaakaay fa eket ápiyisan hamake ha hiti Pútuun pa.) Fiye Yéesu naasokoo: “Napanam!”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ anapana ya aŋa náalafiye ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />
    <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naayeso naacuk pusonoo anapana ya aŋa Yéesu náalafiye ya ti kanapanii. Anapana ya aŋuu, akina ayaaciye fa hínum ti Yéesu ta nkayeniye ta hili káciim ka naacakanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, ayme akaakaay hífulu ti awe?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ta Piyeer naacuke ta anapana ya aŋuu naacakan Yéesu: “Ahámpaatiin, áyiin a aŋe me?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Niŋ inci láfiyaa aputowo kaloŋa fo ta inci fáñohoonii, ekina weyme ti awe? Awe, nápaniyam!” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Kamma eehuu, hilim nihiyeno katey ti pututa kéeyinane ka nii anapana ya aŋuu ataket. Pale Yéesu asokut nii anapana ya aŋuu ataket, asok: “Niŋ inci láfiyaa aputowo kaloŋa fo ta inci fáñohoonii, ekina weyme ti awe?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Akina ayem anapana ya eetantake ya enkuu, naakiic ko. Núumeyi nii eeha naasoke ha hiti pánipani. <verse eid="JHN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yéesu hícump ukee waah náahine. Niŋ ukina púlooŋ ukiicee woonool woonool, inci incukam nii háati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> étipiyini kayekan oom púpukoo.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>